window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b022-e03ab299f0192588.json"]={sha256:"e03ab299f0192588d48916de6edf56ef74b6c5510f2b42b31f1ea2278b5f0f75",value:{"id":"b022","title":"哈里發塔","titleEn":"Burj Khalifa","category":"structures","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從 Y 形扶壁核心的傳力與各向同性勁度、螺旋退縮與風洞定向出發，計算 C80 牆體在徐變下的鋼筋分擔、3.7 m 筏基與摩擦樁的承載，再處理自爬模核心先行、約 600 m 的混凝土泵送、GPS 垂直度控制、應變監測分解，最後是鹽水地層的基礎耐久與外牆維護系統的交接。","summaryEn":"Starting from the load path and direction-independent stiffness of the Y-shaped buttressed core and from spiralling setbacks and wind-tunnel orientation, compute creep-driven load sharing in C80 walls and the capacity of the 3.7 m raft and friction piles, then handle core-first self-climbing formwork, pumping concrete to about 600 m, GPS verticality control and strain decomposition, ending with foundation durability in saline ground and the handover of the façade access system.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、吊裝或張拉作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, lifting or stressing permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"st-supertall","subcategoryTitle":"超高層建築巨作","subcategoryTitleEn":"Supertall building landmarks","learningTrack":"structures","learningSubdiscipline":"st-supertall","learningTags":["structures","st-supertall","tower"],"architectureFamily":"tower","architectureNodes":[["六角中央核心","Hexagonal central core"],["三翼走廊牆與周邊柱","Wing corridor walls and perimeter columns"],["機械層外伸臂","Mechanical-floor outriggers"],["鋼結構塔尖","Structural steel spire"],["筏基與摩擦樁","Raft and friction piles"],["測量與應變監測","Survey and strain monitoring"]],"architectureEdges":[[1,0],[2,0],[2,1],[3,0],[0,4],[1,4],[5,0]],"diagram":{"type":"tower","labels":["六角中央核心","三翼走廊牆與周邊柱","機械層外伸臂","鋼結構塔尖","筏基與摩擦樁"],"labelsEn":["Hexagonal central core","Wing corridor walls and perimeter columns","Mechanical-floor outriggers","Structural steel spire","Raft and friction piles"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"垂直縮短補償練習：某核心牆長期軸壓 15 MPa，C80 混凝土 E_c = 43.8 GPa。彈性應變 15/43,800 ≈ 342 με；徐變係數取 1.2，徐變應變約 411 με；乾縮取 200 με，總應變約 953 με。牆高 400 m 時總縮短約 953×10⁻⁶×400,000 ≈ 381 mm，平均每 3.5 m 樓層約 3.3 mm，因此每層模板標高可預加約 3 mm，並在施工中依量測修正。若改用 E_c = 36 GPa 的較低強度混凝土，彈性應變約 417 με、總應變約 1,117 με，總縮短增為約 447 mm，每層約 3.9 mm。周邊柱若應力較高、縮短較多，牆柱之間的差異縮短會使樓板傾斜，必須分別補償。數值為教學假設，不代表哈里發塔的設計值。","textEn":"Vertical shortening compensation: a core wall carries 15 MPa sustained stress in C80 concrete with E_c = 43.8 GPa. The elastic strain is 15/43,800 ≈ 342 με; with a creep coefficient of 1.2 the creep strain is about 411 με, and shrinkage of 200 με brings the total to about 953 με. Over 400 m of wall this is about 953×10⁻⁶×400,000 ≈ 381 mm of shortening, or about 3.3 mm per 3.5 m storey, so each floor's formwork level can be raised by about 3 mm and corrected from measurements during construction. With a lower-strength concrete of E_c = 36 GPa the elastic strain is about 417 με, the total about 1,117 με and the shortening rises to about 447 mm, about 3.9 mm per storey. If perimeter columns are more highly stressed and shorten more, the differential shortening between walls and columns tilts the slabs and must be compensated separately. Values are teaching assumptions, not Burj Khalifa's design values.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":13,"enrichmentVersion":13,"stages":[{"id":"b022-v13-s1","title":"工程背景、荷載與結構系統","titleEn":"Context, loads and structural system","description":"本階段聚焦「扶壁核心的傳力與各向同性勁度」與「退縮擾亂渦流與風洞定向」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Buttressed-core load path and direction-independent stiffness\" and \"Setbacks that confuse vortices and wind-tunnel orientation\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b022-v13-01","title":"扶壁核心的傳力與各向同性勁度：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Buttressed-core load path and direction-independent stiffness: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「Y 形扶壁核心」如何影響哈里發塔的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Y-shaped buttressed core” governs force, deformation or durability in “Burj Khalifa”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"哈里發塔的平面是三翼的 Y 形，中央六角形核心由三翼的走廊牆像扶壁一樣互相撐住，每一翼都有自己的高性能混凝土核心牆與周邊柱，機械層另設五組外伸臂把核心與周邊柱連成整體。這種配置使扭轉勁度很高，三翼對稱也讓側向勁度幾乎不隨風向改變；上層柱對齊下層牆，形成連續傳力路徑，避免轉換構件及其造成的工期延誤。塔頂以鋼結構塔尖延續中央核心。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「Y 形扶壁核心」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Burj Khalifa's plan is a three-winged Y. A central hexagonal core is buttressed by the corridor walls of the three wings, each wing has its own high-performance concrete core walls and perimeter columns, and five sets of outriggers at mechanical floors tie the core to the perimeter columns. This arrangement gives very high torsional stiffness, and the three-fold symmetry makes lateral stiffness almost independent of wind direction; columns above align with walls below to form a continuous load path, avoiding transfer structures and the delays they bring. At the top the central core continues as a structural steel spire. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Y-shaped buttressed core” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：三翼牆群對形心的慣性矩 I = Σ A·(d·cosθ)²。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Moment of inertia of the wing-wall groups about the centroid, I = Σ A·(d·cosθ)².","failure":"常見誤解：「Y 形平面只是為了造型與景觀，對結構沒有好處。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The Y-shaped plan is only for appearance and views and gives no structural benefit.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「Y 形扶壁核心」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Y-shaped buttressed core”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-01-k1","title":"扶壁核心的傳力與各向同性勁度","titleEn":"Buttressed-core load path and direction-independent stiffness","text":"哈里發塔的平面是三翼的 Y 形，中央六角形核心由三翼的走廊牆像扶壁一樣互相撐住，每一翼都有自己的高性能混凝土核心牆與周邊柱，機械層另設五組外伸臂把核心與周邊柱連成整體。這種配置使扭轉勁度很高，三翼對稱也讓側向勁度幾乎不隨風向改變；上層柱對齊下層牆，形成連續傳力路徑，避免轉換構件及其造成的工期延誤。","textEn":"Burj Khalifa's plan is a three-winged Y. A central hexagonal core is buttressed by the corridor walls of the three wings, each wing has its own high-performance concrete core walls and perimeter columns, and five sets of outriggers at mechanical floors tie the core to the perimeter columns.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：Y 形平面只是為了造型與景觀，對結構沒有好處。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The Y-shaped plan is only for appearance and views and gives no structural benefit. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「扶壁核心的傳力與各向同性勁度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Buttressed-core load path and direction-independent stiffness\" is correct?","options":["Y 形平面只是為了造型與景觀，對結構沒有好處。","哈里發塔的平面是三翼的 Y 形，中央六角形核心由三翼的走廊牆像扶壁一樣互相撐住，每一翼都有自己的高性能混凝土核心牆與周邊柱，機械層另設五組外伸臂把核心與周邊柱連成整體。","只要結構夠強，建築外形對風力的影響可以忽略。"],"optionsEn":["The Y-shaped plan is only for appearance and views and gives no structural benefit.","Burj Khalifa's plan is a three-winged Y.","If the structure is strong enough, building shape has negligible effect on wind loads."],"answer":1,"explanation":"哈里發塔的平面是三翼的 Y 形，中央六角形核心由三翼的走廊牆像扶壁一樣互相撐住，每一翼都有自己的高性能混凝土核心牆與周邊柱，機械層另設五組外伸臂把核心與周邊柱連成整體。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Burj Khalifa's plan is a three-winged Y. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b022-v13-02","title":"扶壁核心的傳力與各向同性勁度：定量估算","titleEn":"Buttressed-core load path and direction-independent stiffness: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「Y 形扶壁核心」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Y-shaped buttressed core” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：三翼牆群對形心的慣性矩 I = Σ A·(d·cosθ)²。三翼各 A = 60 m²、形心距 d = 25 m、夾角 120° 時，任何方向的 Σcos² 都等於 1.5，I = 1.5×60×25² = 56,250 m⁴，與風向無關。若改為兩翼一字形，順翼方向 I = 2×60×25² = 75,000 m⁴，垂直方向只剩牆體自身很小的慣性矩。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Moment of inertia of the wing-wall groups about the centroid, I = Σ A·(d·cosθ)². With three wings of A = 60 m² at d = 25 m and 120° apart, Σcos² equals 1.5 in every direction, so I = 1.5×60×25² = 56,250 m⁴ regardless of wind direction. A two-winged straight plan gives I = 2×60×25² = 75,000 m⁴ along the wings but only the walls' small self-inertia across them. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以三維殼元素模型（公開論文中的模型超過 73,500 個殼元素與 75,000 個節點）在 0° 至 360° 每隔 15° 施加單位側力，確認頂層變位與基底反力幾乎不隨方向改變；再逐一檢查各翼退縮處的柱牆對位與樓板傳力，確認沒有隱藏的轉換構件。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Apply unit lateral loads every 15° from 0° to 360° to a three-dimensional shell model (the published model had more than 73,500 shell elements and 75,000 nodes) and confirm that top displacement and base reactions barely change with direction; then check column-to-wall alignment and slab load transfer at each wing setback to confirm there are no hidden transfer members.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"三翼牆群對形心的慣性矩 I = Σ A·(d·cosθ)²。三翼各 A = 60 m²、形心距 d = 25 m、夾角 120° 時，任何方向的 Σcos² 都等於 1.5，I = 1.5×60×25² = 56,250 m⁴，與風向無關。若改為兩翼一字形，順翼方向 I = 2×60×25² = 75,000 m⁴，垂直方向只剩牆體自身很小的慣性矩。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Moment of inertia of the wing-wall groups about the centroid, I = Σ A·(d·cosθ)². With three wings of A = 60 m² at d = 25 m and 120° apart, Σcos² equals 1.5 in every direction, so I = 1.5×60×25² = 56,250 m⁴ regardless of wind direction. A two-winged straight plan gives I = 2×60×25² = 75,000 m⁴ along the wings but only the walls' small self-inertia across them. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「扶壁核心的傳力與各向同性勁度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Buttressed-core load path and direction-independent stiffness\", which statement holds?","options":["沒有打到堅硬岩盤的摩擦樁，不能支承超高層建築。","泵送高度只取決於泵機馬力，與混凝土配比無關。","三翼牆群對形心的慣性矩 I = Σ A·(d·cosθ)²。"],"optionsEn":["Friction piles that do not reach hard rock cannot support a supertall tower.","Pumping height depends only on pump power, not on the concrete mix.","Moment of inertia of the wing-wall groups about the centroid, I = Σ A·(d·cosθ)²."],"answer":2,"explanation":"三翼牆群對形心的慣性矩 I = Σ A·(d·cosθ)²。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Moment of inertia of the wing-wall groups about the centroid, I = Σ A·(d·cosθ)². Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b022-v13-03","title":"扶壁核心的傳力與各向同性勁度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Buttressed-core load path and direction-independent stiffness: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「Y 形扶壁核心」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Y-shaped buttressed core” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以三維殼元素模型（公開論文中的模型超過 73,500 個殼元素與 75,000 個節點）在 0° 至 360° 每隔 15° 施加單位側力，確認頂層變位與基底反力幾乎不隨方向改變；再逐一檢查各翼退縮處的柱牆對位與樓板傳力，確認沒有隱藏的轉換構件。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Apply unit lateral loads every 15° from 0° to 360° to a three-dimensional shell model (the published model had more than 73,500 shell elements and 75,000 nodes) and confirm that top displacement and base reactions barely change with direction; then check column-to-wall alignment and slab load transfer at each wing setback to confirm there are no hidden transfer members. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：退縮樓層的平面圖要套疊上下兩層的牆柱位置，標明每支柱的承載牆編號；任何建築平面調整若造成柱牆錯位，須由結構工程師評估後才能定案。","observationEn":"Site practice: Overlay wall and column positions of the floors above and below on every setback plan, labelling the supporting wall of each column; any architectural change that misaligns a column and wall must be assessed by the structural engineer before it is fixed.","failure":"注意干擾：若某一翼退縮處的柱子沒有落在下方牆上，就必須以轉換梁承接，造成局部應力集中與施工停頓；若三翼核心牆在退縮處厚度突變，剛度不連續會使內力集中在該樓層的樓板與連梁上。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: If a column at a wing setback does not land on the wall below, a transfer beam must pick it up, causing local stress concentration and a construction pause; if the wing core walls change thickness abruptly at a setback, the stiffness discontinuity concentrates forces in that floor's slabs and link beams. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以三維殼元素模型（公開論文中的模型超過 73,500 個殼元素與 75,000 個節點）在 0° 至 360° 每隔 15° 施加單位側力，確認頂層變位與基底反力幾乎不隨方向改變；再逐一檢查各翼退縮處的柱牆對位與樓板傳力，確認沒有隱藏的轉換構件。","textEn":"Apply unit lateral loads every 15° from 0° to 360° to a three-dimensional shell model (the published model had more than 73,500 shell elements and 75,000 nodes) and confirm that top displacement and base reactions barely change with direction; then check column-to-wall alignment and slab load transfer at each wing setback to confirm there are no hidden transfer members.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"退縮樓層的平面圖要套疊上下兩層的牆柱位置，標明每支柱的承載牆編號；任何建築平面調整若造成柱牆錯位，須由結構工程師評估後才能定案。","textEn":"Overlay wall and column positions of the floors above and below on every setback plan, labelling the supporting wall of each column; any architectural change that misaligns a column and wall must be assessed by the structural engineer before it is fixed.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「扶壁核心的傳力與各向同性勁度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Buttressed-core load path and direction-independent stiffness\"?","options":["以三維殼元素模型（公開論文中的模型超過 73,500 個殼元素與 75,000 個節點）在 0° 至 360° 每隔 15° 施加單位側力，確認頂層變位與基底反力幾乎不隨方向改變。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","應變計讀數乘上彈性模數，就是構件的實際應力。"],"optionsEn":["Apply unit lateral loads every 15° from 0° to 360° to a three-dimensional shell model (the published model had more than 73,500 shell elements and 75,000 nodes) and confirm that top displacement and base reactions barely change with direction.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Multiplying a strain-gauge reading by the elastic modulus gives the member's actual stress."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以三維殼元素模型（公開論文中的模型超過 73,500 個殼元素與 75,000 個節點）在 0° 至 360° 每隔 15° 施加單位側力，確認頂層變位與基底反力幾乎不隨方向改變；再逐一檢查各翼退縮處的柱牆對位與樓板傳力，確認沒有隱藏的轉換構件。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Apply unit lateral loads every 15° from 0° to 360° to a three-dimensional shell model (the published model had more than 73,500 shell elements and 75,000 nodes) and confirm that top displacement and base reactions barely change with direction; then check column-to-wall alignment and slab load transfer at each wing setback to confirm there are no hidden transfer members. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b022-v13-04","title":"扶壁核心的傳力與各向同性勁度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Buttressed-core load path and direction-independent stiffness: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「Y 形扶壁核心」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Y-shaped buttressed core” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若某一翼退縮處的柱子沒有落在下方牆上，就必須以轉換梁承接，造成局部應力集中與施工停頓；若三翼核心牆在退縮處厚度突變，剛度不連續會使內力集中在該樓層的樓板與連梁上。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"If a column at a wing setback does not land on the wall below, a transfer beam must pick it up, causing local stress concentration and a construction pause; if the wing core walls change thickness abruptly at a setback, the stiffness discontinuity concentrates forces in that floor's slabs and link beams. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：塔頂以鋼結構塔尖延續中央核心。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: At the top the central core continues as a structural steel spire.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「Y 形平面只是為了造型與景觀，對結構沒有好處。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The Y-shaped plan is only for appearance and views and gives no structural benefit.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若某一翼退縮處的柱子沒有落在下方牆上，就必須以轉換梁承接，造成局部應力集中與施工停頓；若三翼核心牆在退縮處厚度突變，剛度不連續會使內力集中在該樓層的樓板與連梁上。","textEn":"If a column at a wing setback does not land on the wall below, a transfer beam must pick it up, causing local stress concentration and a construction pause; if the wing core walls change thickness abruptly at a setback, the stiffness discontinuity concentrates forces in that floor's slabs and link beams.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「扶壁核心的傳力與各向同性勁度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Buttressed-core load path and direction-independent stiffness\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","若某一翼退縮處的柱子沒有落在下方牆上，就必須以轉換梁承接，造成局部應力集中與施工停頓。","只要結構夠強，建築外形對風力的影響可以忽略。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","If a column at a wing setback does not land on the wall below, a transfer beam must pick it up, causing local stress concentration and a construction pause.","If the structure is strong enough, building shape has negligible effect on wind loads."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若某一翼退縮處的柱子沒有落在下方牆上，就必須以轉換梁承接，造成局部應力集中與施工停頓；若三翼核心牆在退縮處厚度突變，剛度不連續會使內力集中在該樓層的樓板與連梁上。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If a column at a wing setback does not land on the wall below, a transfer beam must pick it up, causing local stress concentration and a construction pause; if the wing core walls change thickness abruptly at a setback, the stiffness discontinuity concentrates forces in that floor's slabs and link beams. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b022-v13-05","title":"退縮擾亂渦流與風洞定向：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Setbacks that confuse vortices and wind-tunnel orientation: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-04"],"objective":"說明「螺旋退縮與風向」如何影響哈里發塔的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Spiralling setbacks and wind directions” governs force, deformation or durability in “Burj Khalifa”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"哈里發塔的三翼依順時針方向逐段退縮，每次退縮都改變建築寬度，使不同高度的渦流脫落頻率彼此錯開，無法沿全高同步形成強烈的橫風向力。RWDI 的風洞試驗以約 1:500 的氣動彈性與力平衡模型為主，依當地氣候定出六個主要風向（三個翼尖方向與三個翼尾方向），並據以調整建築方位。結構分析得到的前兩個側向模態週期約 11.3 s 與 10.2 s，扭轉模態約 4.3 s。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「螺旋退縮與風向」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Burj Khalifa's three wings step back clockwise in a spiral, and every setback changes the building width, so vortex-shedding frequencies at different heights are staggered and cannot lock together into a strong across-wind force over the full height. RWDI's wind-tunnel programme relied mostly on aeroelastic and force-balance models at about 1:500, identified six principal wind directions from the local climate (three wing-nose and three wing-tail directions), and the building orientation was set accordingly. The structural analysis gave first and second lateral periods of about 11.3 s and 10.2 s and a torsional period of about 4.3 s. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Spiralling setbacks and wind directions” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：臨界風速 U_cr = f₁·B/St。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Critical wind speed U_cr = f₁·B/St. With f₁ = 1/11.3 ≈ 0.0885 Hz and St = 0.15, a 60 m wide tier gives U_cr ≈ 0.0885×60/0.15 ≈ 35.4 m/s and a 40 m wide tier about 23.6 m/s, so at any one wind speed only a few heights are near resonance and across-wind forces cannot add up coherently.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要結構夠強，建築外形對風力的影響可以忽略。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If the structure is strong enough, building shape has negligible effect on wind loads.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「螺旋退縮與風向」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Spiralling setbacks and wind directions”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-05-k1","title":"退縮擾亂渦流與風洞定向","titleEn":"Setbacks that confuse vortices and wind-tunnel orientation","text":"哈里發塔的三翼依順時針方向逐段退縮，每次退縮都改變建築寬度，使不同高度的渦流脫落頻率彼此錯開，無法沿全高同步形成強烈的橫風向力。RWDI 的風洞試驗以約 1:500 的氣動彈性與力平衡模型為主，依當地氣候定出六個主要風向（三個翼尖方向與三個翼尾方向），並據以調整建築方位。","textEn":"Burj Khalifa's three wings step back clockwise in a spiral, and every setback changes the building width, so vortex-shedding frequencies at different heights are staggered and cannot lock together into a strong across-wind force over the full height. RWDI's wind-tunnel programme relied mostly on aeroelastic and force-balance models at about 1:500, identified six principal wind directions from the local climate (three wing-nose and three wing-tail directions), and the building orientation was set accordingly.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要結構夠強，建築外形對風力的影響可以忽略。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If the structure is strong enough, building shape has negligible effect on wind loads. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「退縮擾亂渦流與風洞定向」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Setbacks that confuse vortices and wind-tunnel orientation\" is correct?","options":["只要結構夠強，建築外形對風力的影響可以忽略。","混凝土強度夠高，徐變與縮短就可以忽略。","哈里發塔的三翼依順時針方向逐段退縮，每次退縮都改變建築寬度，使不同高度的渦流脫落頻率彼此錯開，無法沿全高同步形成強烈的橫風向力。"],"optionsEn":["If the structure is strong enough, building shape has negligible effect on wind loads.","With high enough concrete strength, creep and shortening can be ignored.","Burj Khalifa's three wings step back clockwise in a spiral, and every setback changes the building width, so vortex-shedding frequencies at different heights are staggered and cannot lock together into a strong across-wind force over the full height."],"answer":2,"explanation":"哈里發塔的三翼依順時針方向逐段退縮，每次退縮都改變建築寬度，使不同高度的渦流脫落頻率彼此錯開，無法沿全高同步形成強烈的橫風向力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Burj Khalifa's three wings step back clockwise in a spiral, and every setback changes the building width, so vortex-shedding frequencies at different heights are staggered and cannot lock together into a strong across-wind force over the full height. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b022-v13-06","title":"退縮擾亂渦流與風洞定向：定量估算","titleEn":"Setbacks that confuse vortices and wind-tunnel orientation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「螺旋退縮與風向」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Spiralling setbacks and wind directions” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：臨界風速 U_cr = f₁·B/St。f₁ = 1/11.3 ≈ 0.0885 Hz、St 取 0.15：寬度 60 m 的樓段 U_cr ≈ 0.0885×60/0.15 ≈ 35.4 m/s，寬度 40 m 的樓段約 23.6 m/s；同一風速下只有少數高度接近共振，橫風向力沿高度無法同步累加。St 與寬度為教學假設，週期取自公開論文。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Critical wind speed U_cr = f₁·B/St. With f₁ = 1/11.3 ≈ 0.0885 Hz and St = 0.15, a 60 m wide tier gives U_cr ≈ 0.0885×60/0.15 ≈ 35.4 m/s and a 40 m wide tier about 23.6 m/s, so at any one wind speed only a few heights are near resonance and across-wind forces cannot add up coherently. St and widths are teaching assumptions; the period is from the published paper. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：比對力平衡試驗的橫風向力頻譜在不同風向下是否出現尖銳峰值，並以氣動彈性模型確認退縮後的響應；風洞結果換算成設計載重後，與規範估算及同儕審查者的獨立判讀比較（本案由 Nick Isyumov 博士做同儕審查）。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check whether the across-wind force spectra from force-balance tests show sharp peaks for different wind directions, and confirm the response after setbacks with aeroelastic models; convert the results into design loads and compare them with code estimates and an independent peer reviewer's reading (Dr Nick Isyumov peer-reviewed this programme).","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"臨界風速 U_cr = f₁·B/St。f₁ = 1/11.3 ≈ 0.0885 Hz、St 取 0.15：寬度 60 m 的樓段 U_cr ≈ 0.0885×60/0.15 ≈ 35.4 m/s，寬度 40 m 的樓段約 23.6 m/s；同一風速下只有少數高度接近共振，橫風向力沿高度無法同步累加。St 與寬度為教學假設，週期取自公開論文。","textEn":"Critical wind speed U_cr = f₁·B/St. With f₁ = 1/11.3 ≈ 0.0885 Hz and St = 0.15, a 60 m wide tier gives U_cr ≈ 0.0885×60/0.15 ≈ 35.4 m/s and a 40 m wide tier about 23.6 m/s, so at any one wind speed only a few heights are near resonance and across-wind forces cannot add up coherently. St and widths are teaching assumptions; the period is from the published paper.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「退縮擾亂渦流與風洞定向」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Setbacks that confuse vortices and wind-tunnel orientation\", which statement holds?","options":["臨界風速 U_cr = f₁·B/St。","爬模只是一套模板，爬升時機由工班依進度自行決定即可。","只要每層都以雷射對準設計座標，建築就一定是直的。"],"optionsEn":["Critical wind speed U_cr = f₁·B/St. With f₁ = 1/11.3 ≈ 0.0885 Hz and St = 0.15, a 60 m wide tier gives U_cr ≈ 0.0885×60/0.15 ≈ 35.4 m/s and a 40 m wide tier about 23.6 m/s, so at any one wind speed only a few heights are near resonance and across-wind forces cannot add up coherently.","A climbing form is just formwork, so the crew can decide when to climb based on progress.","If every floor is laser-aligned to the design coordinates, the building will be straight."],"answer":0,"explanation":"臨界風速 U_cr = f₁·B/St。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Critical wind speed U_cr = f₁·B/St. With f₁ = 1/11.3 ≈ 0.0885 Hz and St = 0.15, a 60 m wide tier gives U_cr ≈ 0.0885×60/0.15 ≈ 35.4 m/s and a 40 m wide tier about 23.6 m/s, so at any one wind speed only a few heights are near resonance and across-wind forces cannot add up coherently. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b022-v13-07","title":"退縮擾亂渦流與風洞定向：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Setbacks that confuse vortices and wind-tunnel orientation: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「螺旋退縮與風向」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Spiralling setbacks and wind directions” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"比對力平衡試驗的橫風向力頻譜在不同風向下是否出現尖銳峰值，並以氣動彈性模型確認退縮後的響應；風洞結果換算成設計載重後，與規範估算及同儕審查者的獨立判讀比較（本案由 Nick Isyumov 博士做同儕審查）。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check whether the across-wind force spectra from force-balance tests show sharp peaks for different wind directions, and confirm the response after setbacks with aeroelastic models; convert the results into design loads and compare them with code estimates and an independent peer reviewer's reading (Dr Nick Isyumov peer-reviewed this programme). Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：在概念設計階段就讓風工程顧問參與外形比選，每一輪外形修改都保留風洞或數值比較紀錄；設計基準書要寫明採用的主要風向、模型比例與同儕審查結論。","observationEn":"Site practice: Involve the wind consultant in massing studies from the concept stage, keep wind-tunnel or numerical comparisons for every round of shape changes, and state the principal wind directions, model scale and peer-review conclusions in the design basis.","failure":"注意干擾：若退縮的間距與尺寸過於規律，多個高度的渦流頻率可能仍落在相近範圍，在某一風速下出現明顯的橫風向共振；建築方位若未依主要風向調整，最不利的風向可能正對結構較弱的方向。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: If setbacks are too regular in spacing and size, shedding frequencies at many heights may still cluster and produce marked across-wind resonance at one wind speed; if the orientation is not set against the principal wind directions, the worst wind may strike the structure's weaker direction. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"比對力平衡試驗的橫風向力頻譜在不同風向下是否出現尖銳峰值，並以氣動彈性模型確認退縮後的響應；風洞結果換算成設計載重後，與規範估算及同儕審查者的獨立判讀比較（本案由 Nick Isyumov 博士做同儕審查）。","textEn":"Check whether the across-wind force spectra from force-balance tests show sharp peaks for different wind directions, and confirm the response after setbacks with aeroelastic models; convert the results into design loads and compare them with code estimates and an independent peer reviewer's reading (Dr Nick Isyumov peer-reviewed this programme).","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"在概念設計階段就讓風工程顧問參與外形比選，每一輪外形修改都保留風洞或數值比較紀錄；設計基準書要寫明採用的主要風向、模型比例與同儕審查結論。","textEn":"Involve the wind consultant in massing studies from the concept stage, keep wind-tunnel or numerical comparisons for every round of shape changes, and state the principal wind directions, model scale and peer-review conclusions in the design basis.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「退縮擾亂渦流與風洞定向」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Setbacks that confuse vortices and wind-tunnel orientation\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","比對力平衡試驗的橫風向力頻譜在不同風向下是否出現尖銳峰值，並以氣動彈性模型確認退縮後的響應。","基礎埋在地下、不接觸空氣，所以不會腐蝕。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Check whether the across-wind force spectra from force-balance tests show sharp peaks for different wind directions, and confirm the response after setbacks with aeroelastic models.","Foundations are buried away from air, so they cannot corrode."],"answer":1,"explanation":"比對力平衡試驗的橫風向力頻譜在不同風向下是否出現尖銳峰值，並以氣動彈性模型確認退縮後的響應；風洞結果換算成設計載重後，與規範估算及同儕審查者的獨立判讀比較（本案由 Nick Isyumov 博士做同儕審查）。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check whether the across-wind force spectra from force-balance tests show sharp peaks for different wind directions, and confirm the response after setbacks with aeroelastic models; convert the results into design loads and compare them with code estimates and an independent peer reviewer's reading (Dr Nick Isyumov peer-reviewed this programme). Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b022-v13-08","title":"退縮擾亂渦流與風洞定向：失效診斷","titleEn":"Setbacks that confuse vortices and wind-tunnel orientation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「螺旋退縮與風向」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Spiralling setbacks and wind directions” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若退縮的間距與尺寸過於規律，多個高度的渦流頻率可能仍落在相近範圍，在某一風速下出現明顯的橫風向共振；建築方位若未依主要風向調整，最不利的風向可能正對結構較弱的方向。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"If setbacks are too regular in spacing and size, shedding frequencies at many heights may still cluster and produce marked across-wind resonance at one wind speed; if the orientation is not set against the principal wind directions, the worst wind may strike the structure's weaker direction. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：結構分析得到的前兩個側向模態週期約 11.3 s 與 10.2 s，扭轉模態約 4.3 s。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The structural analysis gave first and second lateral periods of about 11.3 s and 10.2 s and a torsional period of about 4.3 s.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要結構夠強，建築外形對風力的影響可以忽略。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If the structure is strong enough, building shape has negligible effect on wind loads.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若退縮的間距與尺寸過於規律，多個高度的渦流頻率可能仍落在相近範圍，在某一風速下出現明顯的橫風向共振；建築方位若未依主要風向調整，最不利的風向可能正對結構較弱的方向。","textEn":"If setbacks are too regular in spacing and size, shedding frequencies at many heights may still cluster and produce marked across-wind resonance at one wind speed; if the orientation is not set against the principal wind directions, the worst wind may strike the structure's weaker direction.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「退縮擾亂渦流與風洞定向」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Setbacks that confuse vortices and wind-tunnel orientation\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","混凝土強度夠高，徐變與縮短就可以忽略。","若退縮的間距與尺寸過於規律，多個高度的渦流頻率可能仍落在相近範圍，在某一風速下出現明顯的橫風向共振。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","With high enough concrete strength, creep and shortening can be ignored.","If setbacks are too regular in spacing and size, shedding frequencies at many heights may still cluster and produce marked across-wind resonance at one wind speed."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若退縮的間距與尺寸過於規律，多個高度的渦流頻率可能仍落在相近範圍，在某一風速下出現明顯的橫風向共振；建築方位若未依主要風向調整，最不利的風向可能正對結構較弱的方向。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If setbacks are too regular in spacing and size, shedding frequencies at many heights may still cluster and produce marked across-wind resonance at one wind speed; if the orientation is not set against the principal wind directions, the worst wind may strike the structure's weaker direction. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b022-v13-s2","title":"材料、構件與接合細部","titleEn":"Materials, members and connection details","description":"本階段聚焦「高性能混凝土與鋼筋的長期分擔」與「筏基、摩擦樁與承載驗證」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"High-performance concrete and long-term load sharing with reinforcement\" and \"Raft, friction piles and capacity proof\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b022-v13-09","title":"高性能混凝土與鋼筋的長期分擔：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"High-performance concrete and long-term load sharing with reinforcement: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-08"],"objective":"說明「C80 高性能混凝土牆」如何影響哈里發塔的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “C80 high-performance concrete walls” governs force, deformation or durability in “Burj Khalifa”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"哈里發塔的牆體混凝土由 C80 逐段降到 C60（立方試體強度），以普通水泥加飛灰與矽灰配製，C80 在 90 天的彈性模數約 43,800 MPa；周邊柱與典型走廊牆厚約 600 mm，鋼筋約佔混凝土面積 1%。混凝土在長期載重下徐變與乾縮，會把一部分軸力轉給鋼筋：公開論文指出第 135 層附近鋼筋分擔的比例完工時約 15%，30 年後約 30%。這個轉移影響鋼筋應力、牆柱縮短量與樓板傾斜。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「C80 高性能混凝土牆」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Burj Khalifa's wall concrete steps down from C80 to C60 cube strength, made with Portland cement, fly ash and silica fume; the C80 had an elastic modulus of about 43,800 MPa at 90 days. Perimeter columns and typical corridor walls are about 600 mm thick with reinforcement around 1% of the concrete area. Creep and shrinkage under sustained load transfer part of the axial force to the bars: the published paper notes that near level 135 the reinforcement carries about 15% at completion and about 30% after 30 years. This transfer affects bar stresses, wall and column shortening and slab tilt. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “C80 high-performance concrete walls” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：換算斷面的鋼筋分擔 = nρ/[1 + (n−1)ρ]。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Transformed-section steel share = nρ/[1 + (n−1)ρ].","failure":"常見誤解：「混凝土強度夠高，徐變與縮短就可以忽略。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"With high enough concrete strength, creep and shortening can be ignored.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「C80 高性能混凝土牆」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “C80 high-performance concrete walls”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-09-k1","title":"高性能混凝土與鋼筋的長期分擔","titleEn":"High-performance concrete and long-term load sharing with reinforcement","text":"哈里發塔的牆體混凝土由 C80 逐段降到 C60（立方試體強度），以普通水泥加飛灰與矽灰配製，C80 在 90 天的彈性模數約 43,800 MPa；周邊柱與典型走廊牆厚約 600 mm，鋼筋約佔混凝土面積 1%。混凝土在長期載重下徐變與乾縮，會把一部分軸力轉給鋼筋：公開論文指出第 135 層附近鋼筋分擔的比例完工時約 15%，30 年後約 30%。","textEn":"Burj Khalifa's wall concrete steps down from C80 to C60 cube strength, made with Portland cement, fly ash and silica fume; the C80 had an elastic modulus of about 43,800 MPa at 90 days. Perimeter columns and typical corridor walls are about 600 mm thick with reinforcement around 1% of the concrete area.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：混凝土強度夠高，徐變與縮短就可以忽略。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: With high enough concrete strength, creep and shortening can be ignored. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「高性能混凝土與鋼筋的長期分擔」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"High-performance concrete and long-term load sharing with reinforcement\" is correct?","options":["哈里發塔的牆體混凝土由 C80 逐段降到 C60（立方試體強度），以普通水泥加飛灰與矽灰配製，C80 在 90 天的彈性模數約 43,800 MPa。","混凝土強度夠高，徐變與縮短就可以忽略。","沒有打到堅硬岩盤的摩擦樁，不能支承超高層建築。"],"optionsEn":["Burj Khalifa's wall concrete steps down from C80 to C60 cube strength, made with Portland cement, fly ash and silica fume.","With high enough concrete strength, creep and shortening can be ignored.","Friction piles that do not reach hard rock cannot support a supertall tower."],"answer":0,"explanation":"哈里發塔的牆體混凝土由 C80 逐段降到 C60（立方試體強度），以普通水泥加飛灰與矽灰配製，C80 在 90 天的彈性模數約 43,800 MPa；周邊柱與典型走廊牆厚約 600 mm，鋼筋約佔混凝土面積 1%。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Burj Khalifa's wall concrete steps down from C80 to C60 cube strength, made with Portland cement, fly ash and silica fume; the C80 had an elastic modulus of about 43,800 MPa at 90 days. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b022-v13-10","title":"高性能混凝土與鋼筋的長期分擔：定量估算","titleEn":"High-performance concrete and long-term load sharing with reinforcement: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「C80 高性能混凝土牆」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “C80 high-performance concrete walls” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：換算斷面的鋼筋分擔 = nρ/[1 + (n−1)ρ]。E_s = 200 GPa、E_c = 43.8 GPa，n = 4.57、ρ = 1%：彈性時分擔 0.0457/1.0357 ≈ 4.4%；徐變係數 φ = 2.0 時有效模數比 n_e = 4.57×3 = 13.7，分擔 0.137/1.127 ≈ 12.2%，再計入乾縮比例還會上升。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Transformed-section steel share = nρ/[1 + (n−1)ρ]. With E_s = 200 GPa and E_c = 43.8 GPa, n = 4.57 and ρ = 1%: the elastic share is 0.0457/1.0357 ≈ 4.4%; with a creep coefficient φ = 2.0 the effective modular ratio is n_e = 4.57×3 = 13.7 and the share is 0.137/1.127 ≈ 12.2%, rising further once shrinkage is included. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以實際配比做 90 天強度與彈性模數試驗，並進行長期徐變與乾縮試驗，把量得的係數代回施工階段分析；在代表性牆柱內埋設振弦式應變計，比較量測應變與預測的彈性、徐變、乾縮分量。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Test the actual mixes for 90-day strength and elastic modulus and run long-term creep and shrinkage tests, feeding the measured coefficients back into the construction-sequence analysis; embed vibrating-wire strain gauges in representative walls and columns and compare measured strain with the predicted elastic, creep and shrinkage components.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"換算斷面的鋼筋分擔 = nρ/[1 + (n−1)ρ]。E_s = 200 GPa、E_c = 43.8 GPa，n = 4.57、ρ = 1%：彈性時分擔 0.0457/1.0357 ≈ 4.4%；徐變係數 φ = 2.0 時有效模數比 n_e = 4.57×3 = 13.7，分擔 0.137/1.127 ≈ 12.2%，再計入乾縮比例還會上升。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Transformed-section steel share = nρ/[1 + (n−1)ρ]. With E_s = 200 GPa and E_c = 43.8 GPa, n = 4.57 and ρ = 1%: the elastic share is 0.0457/1.0357 ≈ 4.4%; with a creep coefficient φ = 2.0 the effective modular ratio is n_e = 4.57×3 = 13.7 and the share is 0.137/1.127 ≈ 12.2%, rising further once shrinkage is included. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「高性能混凝土與鋼筋的長期分擔」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"High-performance concrete and long-term load sharing with reinforcement\", which statement holds?","options":["泵送高度只取決於泵機馬力，與混凝土配比無關。","換算斷面的鋼筋分擔 = nρ/[1 + (n−1)ρ]。","應變計讀數乘上彈性模數，就是構件的實際應力。"],"optionsEn":["Pumping height depends only on pump power, not on the concrete mix.","Transformed-section steel share = nρ/[1 + (n−1)ρ].","Multiplying a strain-gauge reading by the elastic modulus gives the member's actual stress."],"answer":1,"explanation":"換算斷面的鋼筋分擔 = nρ/[1 + (n−1)ρ]。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Transformed-section steel share = nρ/[1 + (n−1)ρ]. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b022-v13-11","title":"高性能混凝土與鋼筋的長期分擔：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"High-performance concrete and long-term load sharing with reinforcement: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「C80 高性能混凝土牆」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “C80 high-performance concrete walls” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以實際配比做 90 天強度與彈性模數試驗，並進行長期徐變與乾縮試驗，把量得的係數代回施工階段分析；在代表性牆柱內埋設振弦式應變計，比較量測應變與預測的彈性、徐變、乾縮分量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Test the actual mixes for 90-day strength and elastic modulus and run long-term creep and shrinkage tests, feeding the measured coefficients back into the construction-sequence analysis; embed vibrating-wire strain gauges in representative walls and columns and compare measured strain with the predicted elastic, creep and shrinkage components. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：配比設計報告要包含 90 天強度、彈性模數、徐變與乾縮的試驗計畫；施工中每批試體結果都回饋給結構分析，必要時修正後續樓層的標高補償，並由設計者確認。","observationEn":"Site practice: The mix-design report should include the test programme for 90-day strength, elastic modulus, creep and shrinkage; feed each batch of results back into the structural analysis during construction and, where needed, revise level compensation for later floors with the designer's confirmation.","failure":"注意干擾：若只以彈性分析設計，長期鋼筋應力可能被低估兩到三倍，高軸力區的鋼筋提早降伏；牆柱縮短量估計錯誤，則讓樓板傾斜，帷幕牆與電梯導軌承受非預期的變形。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Designing from elastic analysis alone can underestimate long-term bar stress two- to threefold, letting bars in heavily loaded zones yield early; wrong shortening estimates tilt slabs and impose unintended deformation on the curtain wall and elevator rails. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以實際配比做 90 天強度與彈性模數試驗，並進行長期徐變與乾縮試驗，把量得的係數代回施工階段分析；在代表性牆柱內埋設振弦式應變計，比較量測應變與預測的彈性、徐變、乾縮分量。","textEn":"Test the actual mixes for 90-day strength and elastic modulus and run long-term creep and shrinkage tests, feeding the measured coefficients back into the construction-sequence analysis; embed vibrating-wire strain gauges in representative walls and columns and compare measured strain with the predicted elastic, creep and shrinkage components.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"配比設計報告要包含 90 天強度、彈性模數、徐變與乾縮的試驗計畫；施工中每批試體結果都回饋給結構分析，必要時修正後續樓層的標高補償，並由設計者確認。","textEn":"The mix-design report should include the test programme for 90-day strength, elastic modulus, creep and shrinkage; feed each batch of results back into the structural analysis during construction and, where needed, revise level compensation for later floors with the designer's confirmation.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「高性能混凝土與鋼筋的長期分擔」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"High-performance concrete and long-term load sharing with reinforcement\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","外牆維護設備只是清潔工具，不屬於結構工程的責任。","以實際配比做 90 天強度與彈性模數試驗，並進行長期徐變與乾縮試驗，把量得的係數代回施工階段分析。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Façade access equipment is just cleaning gear and not a structural engineering responsibility.","Test the actual mixes for 90-day strength and elastic modulus and run long-term creep and shrinkage tests, feeding the measured coefficients back into the construction-sequence analysis."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以實際配比做 90 天強度與彈性模數試驗，並進行長期徐變與乾縮試驗，把量得的係數代回施工階段分析；在代表性牆柱內埋設振弦式應變計，比較量測應變與預測的彈性、徐變、乾縮分量。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Test the actual mixes for 90-day strength and elastic modulus and run long-term creep and shrinkage tests, feeding the measured coefficients back into the construction-sequence analysis; embed vibrating-wire strain gauges in representative walls and columns and compare measured strain with the predicted elastic, creep and shrinkage components. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b022-v13-12","title":"高性能混凝土與鋼筋的長期分擔：失效診斷","titleEn":"High-performance concrete and long-term load sharing with reinforcement: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「C80 高性能混凝土牆」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “C80 high-performance concrete walls” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若只以彈性分析設計，長期鋼筋應力可能被低估兩到三倍，高軸力區的鋼筋提早降伏；牆柱縮短量估計錯誤，則讓樓板傾斜，帷幕牆與電梯導軌承受非預期的變形。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Designing from elastic analysis alone can underestimate long-term bar stress two- to threefold, letting bars in heavily loaded zones yield early; wrong shortening estimates tilt slabs and impose unintended deformation on the curtain wall and elevator rails. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這個轉移影響鋼筋應力、牆柱縮短量與樓板傾斜。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: This transfer affects bar stresses, wall and column shortening and slab tilt.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「混凝土強度夠高，徐變與縮短就可以忽略。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"With high enough concrete strength, creep and shortening can be ignored.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若只以彈性分析設計，長期鋼筋應力可能被低估兩到三倍，高軸力區的鋼筋提早降伏；牆柱縮短量估計錯誤，則讓樓板傾斜，帷幕牆與電梯導軌承受非預期的變形。","textEn":"Designing from elastic analysis alone can underestimate long-term bar stress two- to threefold, letting bars in heavily loaded zones yield early; wrong shortening estimates tilt slabs and impose unintended deformation on the curtain wall and elevator rails.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「高性能混凝土與鋼筋的長期分擔」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"High-performance concrete and long-term load sharing with reinforcement\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["若只以彈性分析設計，長期鋼筋應力可能被低估兩到三倍，高軸力區的鋼筋提早降伏；牆柱縮短量估計錯誤，則讓樓板傾斜，帷幕牆與電梯導軌承受非預期的變形。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","沒有打到堅硬岩盤的摩擦樁，不能支承超高層建築。"],"optionsEn":["Designing from elastic analysis alone can underestimate long-term bar stress two- to threefold, letting bars in heavily loaded zones yield early.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Friction piles that do not reach hard rock cannot support a supertall tower."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若只以彈性分析設計，長期鋼筋應力可能被低估兩到三倍，高軸力區的鋼筋提早降伏；牆柱縮短量估計錯誤，則讓樓板傾斜，帷幕牆與電梯導軌承受非預期的變形。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Designing from elastic analysis alone can underestimate long-term bar stress two- to threefold, letting bars in heavily loaded zones yield early; wrong shortening estimates tilt slabs and impose unintended deformation on the curtain wall and elevator rails. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b022-v13-13","title":"筏基、摩擦樁與承載驗證：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Raft, friction piles and capacity proof: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-12"],"objective":"說明「3.7 m 筏基與鑽掘樁」如何影響哈里發塔的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “The 3.7 m raft and bored piles” governs force, deformation or durability in “Burj Khalifa”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"哈里發塔塔樓坐落在厚 3.7 m 的 C50 自充填混凝土筏基上，筏基分四次澆置，配比含 40% 飛灰、水膠比 0.34；其下為 194 支直徑 1.5 m、長約 43 m 的鑽掘場鑄樁（另有資料記為 192 支），單樁設計容量約 3,000 公噸。地層以弱岩為主，樁主要靠側摩擦承載，公開論文採用的極限單位側摩擦約 250 至 350 kPa，預估長期最大沉陷約 80 mm。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「3.7 m 筏基與鑽掘樁」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Burj Khalifa's tower sits on a 3.7 m thick raft of C50 self-consolidating concrete placed in four pours, with 40% fly ash and a water–cement ratio of 0.34; beneath it are 194 bored cast-in-place piles of 1.5 m diameter and about 43 m length (other sources say 192), each with a design capacity of about 3,000 t. The ground is mainly weak rock, so the piles work mostly in side friction; the published paper used an ultimate unit skin friction of about 250 to 350 kPa and predicted a maximum long-term settlement of about 80 mm. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “The 3.7 m raft and bored piles” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：側摩擦極限容量 Q = π·D·L·f_s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Ultimate side-friction capacity Q = π·D·L·f_s.","failure":"常見誤解：「沒有打到堅硬岩盤的摩擦樁，不能支承超高層建築。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Friction piles that do not reach hard rock cannot support a supertall tower.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「3.7 m 筏基與鑽掘樁」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “The 3.7 m raft and bored piles”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-13-k1","title":"筏基、摩擦樁與承載驗證","titleEn":"Raft, friction piles and capacity proof","text":"哈里發塔塔樓坐落在厚 3.7 m 的 C50 自充填混凝土筏基上，筏基分四次澆置，配比含 40% 飛灰、水膠比 0.34；其下為 194 支直徑 1.5 m、長約 43 m 的鑽掘場鑄樁（另有資料記為 192 支），單樁設計容量約 3,000 公噸。地層以弱岩為主，樁主要靠側摩擦承載，公開論文採用的極限單位側摩擦約 250 至 350 kPa，預估長期最大沉陷約 80 mm。","textEn":"Burj Khalifa's tower sits on a 3.7 m thick raft of C50 self-consolidating concrete placed in four pours, with 40% fly ash and a water–cement ratio of 0.34; beneath it are 194 bored cast-in-place piles of 1.5 m diameter and about 43 m length (other sources say 192), each with a design capacity of about 3,000 t. The ground is mainly weak rock, so the piles work mostly in side friction; the published paper used an ultimate unit skin friction of about 250 to 350 kPa and predicted a maximum long-term settlement of about 80 mm.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：沒有打到堅硬岩盤的摩擦樁，不能支承超高層建築。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Friction piles that do not reach hard rock cannot support a supertall tower. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「筏基、摩擦樁與承載驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Raft, friction piles and capacity proof\" is correct?","options":["沒有打到堅硬岩盤的摩擦樁，不能支承超高層建築。","哈里發塔塔樓坐落在厚 3.7 m 的 C50 自充填混凝土筏基上，筏基分四次澆置，配比含 40% 飛灰、水膠比 0.34。","爬模只是一套模板，爬升時機由工班依進度自行決定即可。"],"optionsEn":["Friction piles that do not reach hard rock cannot support a supertall tower.","Burj Khalifa's tower sits on a 3.7 m thick raft of C50 self-consolidating concrete placed in four pours, with 40% fly ash and a water–cement ratio of 0.34.","A climbing form is just formwork, so the crew can decide when to climb based on progress."],"answer":1,"explanation":"哈里發塔塔樓坐落在厚 3.7 m 的 C50 自充填混凝土筏基上，筏基分四次澆置，配比含 40% 飛灰、水膠比 0.34；其下為 194 支直徑 1.5 m、長約 43 m 的鑽掘場鑄樁（另有資料記為 192 支），單樁設計容量約 3,000 公噸。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Burj Khalifa's tower sits on a 3.7 m thick raft of C50 self-consolidating concrete placed in four pours, with 40% fly ash and a water–cement ratio of 0.34; beneath it are 194 bored cast-in-place piles of 1.5 m diameter and about 43 m length (other sources say 192), each with a design capacity of about 3,000 t. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b022-v13-14","title":"筏基、摩擦樁與承載驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Raft, friction piles and capacity proof: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「3.7 m 筏基與鑽掘樁」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “The 3.7 m raft and bored piles” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：側摩擦極限容量 Q = π·D·L·f_s。D = 1.5 m、L = 43 m、f_s = 300 kPa：Q = π×1.5×43×0.30 ≈ 60.8 MN（約 6,200 t），對設計 3,000 t（29.4 MN）的安全係數約 2.07；若 f_s 只有 250 kPa，Q ≈ 50.7 MN，安全係數降為約 1.72。f_s 取公開範圍內的教學值。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Ultimate side-friction capacity Q = π·D·L·f_s. With D = 1.5 m, L = 43 m and f_s = 300 kPa, Q = π×1.5×43×0.30 ≈ 60.8 MN (about 6,200 t), a factor of safety of about 2.07 on the 3,000 t (29.4 MN) design load; with f_s of only 250 kPa, Q ≈ 50.7 MN and the factor falls to about 1.72. f_s is a teaching value within the published range. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以試驗樁加載超過 6,000 t 驗證容量，並以應變計分段量測側摩擦分布；施工時記錄每支樁的鑽掘深度、孔壁穩定與混凝土澆置量，施工中與完工後以水準測量追蹤筏基沉陷，並與預測曲線比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Prove capacity with trial piles loaded above 6,000 t, measuring side friction along the shaft with strain gauges; during construction record drilled depth, bore stability and concrete volume for every pile, and track raft settlement by levelling during and after construction against the predicted curve.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"側摩擦極限容量 Q = π·D·L·f_s。D = 1.5 m、L = 43 m、f_s = 300 kPa：Q = π×1.5×43×0.30 ≈ 60.8 MN（約 6,200 t），對設計 3,000 t（29.4 MN）的安全係數約 2.07；若 f_s 只有 250 kPa，Q ≈ 50.7 MN，安全係數降為約 1.72。f_s 取公開範圍內的教學值。","textEn":"Ultimate side-friction capacity Q = π·D·L·f_s. With D = 1.5 m, L = 43 m and f_s = 300 kPa, Q = π×1.5×43×0.30 ≈ 60.8 MN (about 6,200 t), a factor of safety of about 2.07 on the 3,000 t (29.4 MN) design load; with f_s of only 250 kPa, Q ≈ 50.7 MN and the factor falls to about 1.72. f_s is a teaching value within the published range.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「筏基、摩擦樁與承載驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Raft, friction piles and capacity proof\", which statement holds?","options":["只要每層都以雷射對準設計座標，建築就一定是直的。","基礎埋在地下、不接觸空氣，所以不會腐蝕。","側摩擦極限容量 Q = π·D·L·f_s。"],"optionsEn":["If every floor is laser-aligned to the design coordinates, the building will be straight.","Foundations are buried away from air, so they cannot corrode.","Ultimate side-friction capacity Q = π·D·L·f_s."],"answer":2,"explanation":"側摩擦極限容量 Q = π·D·L·f_s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Ultimate side-friction capacity Q = π·D·L·f_s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b022-v13-15","title":"筏基、摩擦樁與承載驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Raft, friction piles and capacity proof: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「3.7 m 筏基與鑽掘樁」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “The 3.7 m raft and bored piles” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以試驗樁加載超過 6,000 t 驗證容量，並以應變計分段量測側摩擦分布；施工時記錄每支樁的鑽掘深度、孔壁穩定與混凝土澆置量，施工中與完工後以水準測量追蹤筏基沉陷，並與預測曲線比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Prove capacity with trial piles loaded above 6,000 t, measuring side friction along the shaft with strain gauges; during construction record drilled depth, bore stability and concrete volume for every pile, and track raft settlement by levelling during and after construction against the predicted curve. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：試驗樁應在正式施工前完成並回饋到樁長設計；筏基分次澆置的施工縫位置、溫度控制與鋼筋續接須經設計者核可，澆置期間設置溫度監測與停止條件。","observationEn":"Site practice: Complete trial-pile tests before production piling and feed the results back into pile-length design; joint locations between raft pours, temperature control and bar splices need the designer's approval, with temperature monitoring and stop criteria during placement.","failure":"注意干擾：鑽掘時若孔壁泥膜過厚或孔底沉渣未清除，側摩擦與端承都會下降，個別樁偏軟會造成筏基不均勻沉陷；高鹽分地下水若侵入品質不佳的樁身混凝土，鋼筋腐蝕會在數十年後削弱樁的承載。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A thick filter cake on the bore wall or uncleaned base debris reduces both skin friction and end bearing, and individual soft piles cause uneven raft settlement; if saline groundwater penetrates poor-quality pile concrete, reinforcement corrosion weakens the piles decades later. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以試驗樁加載超過 6,000 t 驗證容量，並以應變計分段量測側摩擦分布；施工時記錄每支樁的鑽掘深度、孔壁穩定與混凝土澆置量，施工中與完工後以水準測量追蹤筏基沉陷，並與預測曲線比較。","textEn":"Prove capacity with trial piles loaded above 6,000 t, measuring side friction along the shaft with strain gauges; during construction record drilled depth, bore stability and concrete volume for every pile, and track raft settlement by levelling during and after construction against the predicted curve.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"試驗樁應在正式施工前完成並回饋到樁長設計；筏基分次澆置的施工縫位置、溫度控制與鋼筋續接須經設計者核可，澆置期間設置溫度監測與停止條件。","textEn":"Complete trial-pile tests before production piling and feed the results back into pile-length design; joint locations between raft pours, temperature control and bar splices need the designer's approval, with temperature monitoring and stop criteria during placement.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「筏基、摩擦樁與承載驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Raft, friction piles and capacity proof\"?","options":["以試驗樁加載超過 6,000 t 驗證容量，並以應變計分段量測側摩擦分布。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","Y 形平面只是為了造型與景觀，對結構沒有好處。"],"optionsEn":["Prove capacity with trial piles loaded above 6,000 t, measuring side friction along the shaft with strain gauges.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","The Y-shaped plan is only for appearance and views and gives no structural benefit."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以試驗樁加載超過 6,000 t 驗證容量，並以應變計分段量測側摩擦分布；施工時記錄每支樁的鑽掘深度、孔壁穩定與混凝土澆置量，施工中與完工後以水準測量追蹤筏基沉陷，並與預測曲線比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Prove capacity with trial piles loaded above 6,000 t, measuring side friction along the shaft with strain gauges; during construction record drilled depth, bore stability and concrete volume for every pile, and track raft settlement by levelling during and after construction against the predicted curve. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b022-v13-16","title":"筏基、摩擦樁與承載驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Raft, friction piles and capacity proof: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「3.7 m 筏基與鑽掘樁」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “The 3.7 m raft and bored piles” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"鑽掘時若孔壁泥膜過厚或孔底沉渣未清除，側摩擦與端承都會下降，個別樁偏軟會造成筏基不均勻沉陷；高鹽分地下水若侵入品質不佳的樁身混凝土，鋼筋腐蝕會在數十年後削弱樁的承載。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A thick filter cake on the bore wall or uncleaned base debris reduces both skin friction and end bearing, and individual soft piles cause uneven raft settlement; if saline groundwater penetrates poor-quality pile concrete, reinforcement corrosion weakens the piles decades later. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：地層以弱岩為主，樁主要靠側摩擦承載，公開論文採用的極限單位側摩擦約 250 至 350 kPa，預估長期最大沉陷約 80 mm。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The ground is mainly weak rock, so the piles work mostly in side friction; the published paper used an ultimate unit skin friction of about 250 to 350 kPa and predicted a maximum long-term settlement of about 80 mm.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「沒有打到堅硬岩盤的摩擦樁，不能支承超高層建築。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Friction piles that do not reach hard rock cannot support a supertall tower.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"鑽掘時若孔壁泥膜過厚或孔底沉渣未清除，側摩擦與端承都會下降，個別樁偏軟會造成筏基不均勻沉陷；高鹽分地下水若侵入品質不佳的樁身混凝土，鋼筋腐蝕會在數十年後削弱樁的承載。","textEn":"A thick filter cake on the bore wall or uncleaned base debris reduces both skin friction and end bearing, and individual soft piles cause uneven raft settlement; if saline groundwater penetrates poor-quality pile concrete, reinforcement corrosion weakens the piles decades later.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「筏基、摩擦樁與承載驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Raft, friction piles and capacity proof\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","鑽掘時若孔壁泥膜過厚或孔底沉渣未清除，側摩擦與端承都會下降，個別樁偏軟會造成筏基不均勻沉陷。","爬模只是一套模板，爬升時機由工班依進度自行決定即可。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","A thick filter cake on the bore wall or uncleaned base debris reduces both skin friction and end bearing, and individual soft piles cause uneven raft settlement.","A climbing form is just formwork, so the crew can decide when to climb based on progress."],"answer":1,"explanation":"鑽掘時若孔壁泥膜過厚或孔底沉渣未清除，側摩擦與端承都會下降，個別樁偏軟會造成筏基不均勻沉陷；高鹽分地下水若侵入品質不佳的樁身混凝土，鋼筋腐蝕會在數十年後削弱樁的承載。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A thick filter cake on the bore wall or uncleaned base debris reduces both skin friction and end bearing, and individual soft piles cause uneven raft settlement; if saline groundwater penetrates poor-quality pile concrete, reinforcement corrosion weakens the piles decades later. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b022-v13-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「核心先行的自爬模施工」與「約 600 m 的混凝土泵送與塔尖鋼構」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Core-first construction with self-climbing formwork\" and \"Pumping concrete to about 600 m and the steel spire\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b022-v13-17","title":"核心先行的自爬模施工：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Core-first construction with self-climbing formwork: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-16"],"objective":"說明「自爬模與核心先行」如何影響哈里發塔的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Self-climbing forms and core-first sequence” governs force, deformation or durability in “Burj Khalifa”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"哈里發塔採用 Doka SKE 100 自爬式模板，施工順序是先澆中央核心（分三段），再做各翼的牆與樓板，最後是翼尖的柱。核心先行讓塔吊與泵送管沿核心爬升，翼牆與樓板跟在後面，形成垂直方向的流水線；牆筋預先綁成約 8 m 長的鋼筋籠，以縮短高空作業時間。混凝土要求 10 小時達到約 10 MPa，模板才能及早脫模爬升。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「自爬模與核心先行」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Burj Khalifa used Doka SKE 100 self-climbing formwork with a sequence of central core first, in three sections, then the wing walls and slabs, and finally the nose columns. Leading with the core lets cranes and pump lines climb with it while wing walls and slabs follow, forming a vertical production line; wall reinforcement was prefabricated in cages about 8 m long to cut work at height. The concrete was required to reach about 10 MPa in 10 hours so forms could be stripped and climbed early. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Self-climbing forms and core-first sequence” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：樓層週期與工期：每層 3 天、150 層時純結構工期約 150×3 = 450 天，週期縮短為 2.5 天時約 375 天。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Floor cycle and duration: at 3 days per floor for 150 floors the structure alone takes about 150×3 = 450 days, or about 375 days at 2.5 days per floor.","failure":"常見誤解：「爬模只是一套模板，爬升時機由工班依進度自行決定即可。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A climbing form is just formwork, so the crew can decide when to climb based on progress.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「自爬模與核心先行」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Self-climbing forms and core-first sequence”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-17-k1","title":"核心先行的自爬模施工","titleEn":"Core-first construction with self-climbing formwork","text":"哈里發塔採用 Doka SKE 100 自爬式模板，施工順序是先澆中央核心（分三段），再做各翼的牆與樓板，最後是翼尖的柱。核心先行讓塔吊與泵送管沿核心爬升，翼牆與樓板跟在後面，形成垂直方向的流水線；牆筋預先綁成約 8 m 長的鋼筋籠，以縮短高空作業時間。","textEn":"Burj Khalifa used Doka SKE 100 self-climbing formwork with a sequence of central core first, in three sections, then the wing walls and slabs, and finally the nose columns. Leading with the core lets cranes and pump lines climb with it while wing walls and slabs follow, forming a vertical production line; wall reinforcement was prefabricated in cages about 8 m long to cut work at height.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：爬模只是一套模板，爬升時機由工班依進度自行決定即可。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A climbing form is just formwork, so the crew can decide when to climb based on progress. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「核心先行的自爬模施工」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Core-first construction with self-climbing formwork\" is correct?","options":["爬模只是一套模板，爬升時機由工班依進度自行決定即可。","泵送高度只取決於泵機馬力，與混凝土配比無關。","哈里發塔採用 Doka SKE 100 自爬式模板，施工順序是先澆中央核心（分三段），再做各翼的牆與樓板，最後是翼尖的柱。"],"optionsEn":["A climbing form is just formwork, so the crew can decide when to climb based on progress.","Pumping height depends only on pump power, not on the concrete mix.","Burj Khalifa used Doka SKE 100 self-climbing formwork with a sequence of central core first, in three sections, then the wing walls and slabs, and finally the nose columns."],"answer":2,"explanation":"哈里發塔採用 Doka SKE 100 自爬式模板，施工順序是先澆中央核心（分三段），再做各翼的牆與樓板，最後是翼尖的柱。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Burj Khalifa used Doka SKE 100 self-climbing formwork with a sequence of central core first, in three sections, then the wing walls and slabs, and finally the nose columns. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b022-v13-18","title":"核心先行的自爬模施工：定量估算","titleEn":"Core-first construction with self-climbing formwork: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「自爬模與核心先行」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Self-climbing forms and core-first sequence” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：樓層週期與工期：每層 3 天、150 層時純結構工期約 150×3 = 450 天，週期縮短為 2.5 天時約 375 天。脫模時機看早期強度：若混凝土 10 小時達 10 MPa、爬模錨固需 8 MPa，以線性增長估計約 8 小時即可爬升，實際仍以試體確認。數值為教學假設，不代表實際工期。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Floor cycle and duration: at 3 days per floor for 150 floors the structure alone takes about 150×3 = 450 days, or about 375 days at 2.5 days per floor. Stripping is governed by early strength: if concrete reaches 10 MPa in 10 hours and the climbing anchors need 8 MPa, a linear-gain estimate allows climbing after about 8 hours, still confirmed by specimens. Values are teaching assumptions, not the actual schedule. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：每一節爬模在脫模前以同條件養護試體或成熟度感測器確認強度，記錄錨固點混凝土強度與爬升時間；核心、翼牆與樓板之間的施工時差要納入施工階段分析，檢查樓板未完成時核心牆的穩定與變形。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before stripping each lift, confirm strength with field-cured specimens or maturity sensors and record anchor-zone strength and climbing time; include the lag between core, wing walls and slabs in the construction-stage analysis, checking core-wall stability and deformation while slabs are incomplete.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"樓層週期與工期：每層 3 天、150 層時純結構工期約 150×3 = 450 天，週期縮短為 2.5 天時約 375 天。脫模時機看早期強度：若混凝土 10 小時達 10 MPa、爬模錨固需 8 MPa，以線性增長估計約 8 小時即可爬升，實際仍以試體確認。數值為教學假設，不代表實際工期。","textEn":"Floor cycle and duration: at 3 days per floor for 150 floors the structure alone takes about 150×3 = 450 days, or about 375 days at 2.5 days per floor. Stripping is governed by early strength: if concrete reaches 10 MPa in 10 hours and the climbing anchors need 8 MPa, a linear-gain estimate allows climbing after about 8 hours, still confirmed by specimens. Values are teaching assumptions, not the actual schedule.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「核心先行的自爬模施工」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Core-first construction with self-climbing formwork\", which statement holds?","options":["樓層週期與工期：每層 3 天、150 層時純結構工期約 150×3 = 450 天，週期縮短為 2.5 天時約 375 天。","應變計讀數乘上彈性模數，就是構件的實際應力。","外牆維護設備只是清潔工具，不屬於結構工程的責任。"],"optionsEn":["Floor cycle and duration: at 3 days per floor for 150 floors the structure alone takes about 150×3 = 450 days, or about 375 days at 2.5 days per floor.","Multiplying a strain-gauge reading by the elastic modulus gives the member's actual stress.","Façade access equipment is just cleaning gear and not a structural engineering responsibility."],"answer":0,"explanation":"樓層週期與工期：每層 3 天、150 層時純結構工期約 150×3 = 450 天，週期縮短為 2.5 天時約 375 天。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Floor cycle and duration: at 3 days per floor for 150 floors the structure alone takes about 150×3 = 450 days, or about 375 days at 2.5 days per floor. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b022-v13-19","title":"核心先行的自爬模施工：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Core-first construction with self-climbing formwork: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「自爬模與核心先行」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Self-climbing forms and core-first sequence” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"每一節爬模在脫模前以同條件養護試體或成熟度感測器確認強度，記錄錨固點混凝土強度與爬升時間；核心、翼牆與樓板之間的施工時差要納入施工階段分析，檢查樓板未完成時核心牆的穩定與變形。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before stripping each lift, confirm strength with field-cured specimens or maturity sensors and record anchor-zone strength and climbing time; include the lag between core, wing walls and slabs in the construction-stage analysis, checking core-wall stability and deformation while slabs are incomplete. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：爬模設計計算、錨固強度門檻與風速停工條件要寫入施工計畫；每次爬升前由現場工程師簽核強度與錨固檢查表，核心與翼牆允許的最大施工時差也要明列並持續監控。","observationEn":"Site practice: Put the climbing-form design calculations, anchor-strength threshold and wind-speed stop limits into the construction plan; a site engineer signs the strength and anchor checklist before every climb, and the maximum allowed lag between core and wings is stated and monitored.","failure":"注意干擾：若在強度不足時爬升，錨固錐周圍混凝土可能被拉裂，整組爬模失去支承；核心與翼牆的施工時差過大時，核心單獨承受風力與吊裝荷重，變形與應力都會超過完工狀態的預期。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Climbing before adequate strength can crack the concrete around anchor cones and leave a whole climbing unit unsupported; if the lag between core and wing walls grows too large, the core alone carries wind and crane loads, with deformations and stresses beyond those expected in the completed state. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每一節爬模在脫模前以同條件養護試體或成熟度感測器確認強度，記錄錨固點混凝土強度與爬升時間；核心、翼牆與樓板之間的施工時差要納入施工階段分析，檢查樓板未完成時核心牆的穩定與變形。","textEn":"Before stripping each lift, confirm strength with field-cured specimens or maturity sensors and record anchor-zone strength and climbing time; include the lag between core, wing walls and slabs in the construction-stage analysis, checking core-wall stability and deformation while slabs are incomplete.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"爬模設計計算、錨固強度門檻與風速停工條件要寫入施工計畫；每次爬升前由現場工程師簽核強度與錨固檢查表，核心與翼牆允許的最大施工時差也要明列並持續監控。","textEn":"Put the climbing-form design calculations, anchor-strength threshold and wind-speed stop limits into the construction plan; a site engineer signs the strength and anchor checklist before every climb, and the maximum allowed lag between core and wings is stated and monitored.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「核心先行的自爬模施工」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Core-first construction with self-climbing formwork\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","每一節爬模在脫模前以同條件養護試體或成熟度感測器確認強度，記錄錨固點混凝土強度與爬升時間。","只要結構夠強，建築外形對風力的影響可以忽略。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Before stripping each lift, confirm strength with field-cured specimens or maturity sensors and record anchor-zone strength and climbing time.","If the structure is strong enough, building shape has negligible effect on wind loads."],"answer":1,"explanation":"每一節爬模在脫模前以同條件養護試體或成熟度感測器確認強度，記錄錨固點混凝土強度與爬升時間；核心、翼牆與樓板之間的施工時差要納入施工階段分析，檢查樓板未完成時核心牆的穩定與變形。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before stripping each lift, confirm strength with field-cured specimens or maturity sensors and record anchor-zone strength and climbing time; include the lag between core, wing walls and slabs in the construction-stage analysis, checking core-wall stability and deformation while slabs are incomplete. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b022-v13-20","title":"核心先行的自爬模施工：失效診斷","titleEn":"Core-first construction with self-climbing formwork: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「自爬模與核心先行」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Self-climbing forms and core-first sequence” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若在強度不足時爬升，錨固錐周圍混凝土可能被拉裂，整組爬模失去支承；核心與翼牆的施工時差過大時，核心單獨承受風力與吊裝荷重，變形與應力都會超過完工狀態的預期。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Climbing before adequate strength can crack the concrete around anchor cones and leave a whole climbing unit unsupported; if the lag between core and wing walls grows too large, the core alone carries wind and crane loads, with deformations and stresses beyond those expected in the completed state. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：混凝土要求 10 小時達到約 10 MPa，模板才能及早脫模爬升。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The concrete was required to reach about 10 MPa in 10 hours so forms could be stripped and climbed early.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「爬模只是一套模板，爬升時機由工班依進度自行決定即可。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A climbing form is just formwork, so the crew can decide when to climb based on progress.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若在強度不足時爬升，錨固錐周圍混凝土可能被拉裂，整組爬模失去支承；核心與翼牆的施工時差過大時，核心單獨承受風力與吊裝荷重，變形與應力都會超過完工狀態的預期。","textEn":"Climbing before adequate strength can crack the concrete around anchor cones and leave a whole climbing unit unsupported; if the lag between core and wing walls grows too large, the core alone carries wind and crane loads, with deformations and stresses beyond those expected in the completed state.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「核心先行的自爬模施工」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Core-first construction with self-climbing formwork\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","泵送高度只取決於泵機馬力，與混凝土配比無關。","若在強度不足時爬升，錨固錐周圍混凝土可能被拉裂，整組爬模失去支承；核心與翼牆的施工時差過大時，核心單獨承受風力與吊裝荷重，變形與應力都會超過完工狀態的預期。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Pumping height depends only on pump power, not on the concrete mix.","Climbing before adequate strength can crack the concrete around anchor cones and leave a whole climbing unit unsupported."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若在強度不足時爬升，錨固錐周圍混凝土可能被拉裂，整組爬模失去支承；核心與翼牆的施工時差過大時，核心單獨承受風力與吊裝荷重，變形與應力都會超過完工狀態的預期。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Climbing before adequate strength can crack the concrete around anchor cones and leave a whole climbing unit unsupported; if the lag between core and wing walls grows too large, the core alone carries wind and crane loads, with deformations and stresses beyond those expected in the completed state. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b022-v13-21","title":"約 600 m 的混凝土泵送與塔尖鋼構：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Pumping concrete to about 600 m and the steel spire: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-20"],"objective":"說明「超高壓泵送管線」如何影響哈里發塔的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Super-high-pressure pump line” governs force, deformation or durability in “Burj Khalifa”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"哈里發塔的混凝土全部由地面泵送：公開論文指出主要配比的泵送壓力上限約 200 bar，泵機可達 350 bar，經 150 mm 管線輸送，並以水平繞管試驗模擬約 600 m 的泵送高度；泵機廠商指出 2008 年以 BSA 14000 SHP-D 泵送到 606 m 創下紀錄。127 層以上把粗骨材最大粒徑由 20 mm 降為 10 mm，以降低堵管風險。再往上改為鋼結構，塔尖使用超過 4,000 公噸以斜撐組成的鋼材。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「超高壓泵送管線」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"All of Burj Khalifa's concrete was pumped from ground level: the published paper sets a pumping-pressure limit of about 200 bar for the main mix, with pumps capable of 350 bar through a 150 mm line, and a horizontal loop trial simulating a pumping height of about 600 m; the pump manufacturer reports a record 606 m pumping height in 2008 with a BSA 14000 SHP-D. Above level 127 the maximum aggregate size dropped from 20 mm to 10 mm to reduce blockage risk. Higher still the structure turns to steel, and the spire uses more than 4,000 t of braced structural steel. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Super-high-pressure pump line” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：泵送壓力 p ≈ ρ·g·h + 摩擦損失。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Pumping pressure p ≈ ρ·g·h + friction loss.","failure":"常見誤解：「泵送高度只取決於泵機馬力，與混凝土配比無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Pumping height depends only on pump power, not on the concrete mix.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「超高壓泵送管線」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Super-high-pressure pump line”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-21-k1","title":"約 600 m 的混凝土泵送與塔尖鋼構","titleEn":"Pumping concrete to about 600 m and the steel spire","text":"哈里發塔的混凝土全部由地面泵送：公開論文指出主要配比的泵送壓力上限約 200 bar，泵機可達 350 bar，經 150 mm 管線輸送，並以水平繞管試驗模擬約 600 m 的泵送高度；泵機廠商指出 2008 年以 BSA 14000 SHP-D 泵送到 606 m 創下紀錄。127 層以上把粗骨材最大粒徑由 20 mm 降為 10 mm，以降低堵管風險。","textEn":"All of Burj Khalifa's concrete was pumped from ground level: the published paper sets a pumping-pressure limit of about 200 bar for the main mix, with pumps capable of 350 bar through a 150 mm line, and a horizontal loop trial simulating a pumping height of about 600 m; the pump manufacturer reports a record 606 m pumping height in 2008 with a BSA 14000 SHP-D. Above level 127 the maximum aggregate size dropped from 20 mm to 10 mm to reduce blockage risk.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：泵送高度只取決於泵機馬力，與混凝土配比無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Pumping height depends only on pump power, not on the concrete mix. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「約 600 m 的混凝土泵送與塔尖鋼構」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pumping concrete to about 600 m and the steel spire\" is correct?","options":["哈里發塔的混凝土全部由地面泵送：公開論文指出主要配比的泵送壓力上限約 200 bar，泵機可達 350 bar，經 150 mm 管線輸送，並以水平繞管試驗模擬約 600 m 的泵送高度。","泵送高度只取決於泵機馬力，與混凝土配比無關。","只要每層都以雷射對準設計座標，建築就一定是直的。"],"optionsEn":["All of Burj Khalifa's concrete was pumped from ground level: the published paper sets a pumping-pressure limit of about 200 bar for the main mix, with pumps capable of 350 bar through a 150 mm line, and a horizontal loop trial simulating a pumping height of about 600 m.","Pumping height depends only on pump power, not on the concrete mix.","If every floor is laser-aligned to the design coordinates, the building will be straight."],"answer":0,"explanation":"哈里發塔的混凝土全部由地面泵送：公開論文指出主要配比的泵送壓力上限約 200 bar，泵機可達 350 bar，經 150 mm 管線輸送，並以水平繞管試驗模擬約 600 m 的泵送高度；泵機廠商指出 2008 年以 BSA 14000 SHP-D 泵送到 606 m 創下紀錄。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"All of Burj Khalifa's concrete was pumped from ground level: the published paper sets a pumping-pressure limit of about 200 bar for the main mix, with pumps capable of 350 bar through a 150 mm line, and a horizontal loop trial simulating a pumping height of about 600 m; the pump manufacturer reports a record 606 m pumping height in 2008 with a BSA 14000 SHP-D. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b022-v13-22","title":"約 600 m 的混凝土泵送與塔尖鋼構：定量估算","titleEn":"Pumping concrete to about 600 m and the steel spire: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「超高壓泵送管線」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Super-high-pressure pump line” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：泵送壓力 p ≈ ρ·g·h + 摩擦損失。靜水壓 2,500×9.81×600 ≈ 14.7 MPa = 147 bar；若管線摩擦損失 0.08 bar/m、管長 650 m，再加約 52 bar，總計約 199 bar，正好貼近 200 bar 上限；配比變黏使摩擦升到 0.12 bar/m 時，總壓約 225 bar 即超標。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Pumping pressure p ≈ ρ·g·h + friction loss. The static head is 2,500×9.81×600 ≈ 14.7 MPa = 147 bar; with a pipe friction loss of 0.08 bar/m over 650 m of line, another 52 bar brings the total to about 199 bar, right at the 200 bar limit; if a stickier mix raises friction to 0.12 bar/m, the total of about 225 bar exceeds it. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：正式泵送前以水平繞管試驗量測每公尺壓力損失與出口坍流度；施工中監測泵壓、管線溫度與出口材料性質，定期取樣試驗強度，並在管線各段訂出洗管與排堵程序。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before production pumping, measure pressure loss per metre and discharge slump flow in a horizontal loop trial; during construction monitor pump pressure, line temperature and discharge properties, sample strength regularly, and set wash-out and blockage-clearing procedures for each line section.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"泵送壓力 p ≈ ρ·g·h + 摩擦損失。靜水壓 2,500×9.81×600 ≈ 14.7 MPa = 147 bar；若管線摩擦損失 0.08 bar/m、管長 650 m，再加約 52 bar，總計約 199 bar，正好貼近 200 bar 上限；配比變黏使摩擦升到 0.12 bar/m 時，總壓約 225 bar 即超標。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Pumping pressure p ≈ ρ·g·h + friction loss. The static head is 2,500×9.81×600 ≈ 14.7 MPa = 147 bar; with a pipe friction loss of 0.08 bar/m over 650 m of line, another 52 bar brings the total to about 199 bar, right at the 200 bar limit; if a stickier mix raises friction to 0.12 bar/m, the total of about 225 bar exceeds it. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「約 600 m 的混凝土泵送與塔尖鋼構」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pumping concrete to about 600 m and the steel spire\", which statement holds?","options":["基礎埋在地下、不接觸空氣，所以不會腐蝕。","泵送壓力 p ≈ ρ·g·h + 摩擦損失。","Y 形平面只是為了造型與景觀，對結構沒有好處。"],"optionsEn":["Foundations are buried away from air, so they cannot corrode.","Pumping pressure p ≈ ρ·g·h + friction loss.","The Y-shaped plan is only for appearance and views and gives no structural benefit."],"answer":1,"explanation":"泵送壓力 p ≈ ρ·g·h + 摩擦損失。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Pumping pressure p ≈ ρ·g·h + friction loss. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b022-v13-23","title":"約 600 m 的混凝土泵送與塔尖鋼構：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pumping concrete to about 600 m and the steel spire: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「超高壓泵送管線」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Super-high-pressure pump line” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"正式泵送前以水平繞管試驗量測每公尺壓力損失與出口坍流度；施工中監測泵壓、管線溫度與出口材料性質，定期取樣試驗強度，並在管線各段訂出洗管與排堵程序。塔尖鋼構分段吊裝或頂升時，須有分階段的穩定與臨時支撐計算。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before production pumping, measure pressure loss per metre and discharge slump flow in a horizontal loop trial; during construction monitor pump pressure, line temperature and discharge properties, sample strength regularly, and set wash-out and blockage-clearing procedures for each line section. Erecting spire steel in segments or by jacking needs stage-by-stage stability and temporary-support calculations. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：泵送計畫要列出每段高度的配比、骨材粒徑、預估壓力與備用泵；管線固定點、彎管與安全護罩須經檢查，壓力超過設定值即停止泵送，由技術主管判斷後才可續作，並禁止現場加水。","observationEn":"Site practice: The pumping plan should list the mix, aggregate size, predicted pressure and standby pump for each height band; pipe anchors, bends and safety guards must be inspected, pumping stops whenever pressure exceeds the set value until the technical manager decides, and adding water on site is prohibited.","failure":"注意干擾：高空堵管時，管內混凝土在數百 bar 壓力下硬化，必須拆管清除，工期延誤並有爆管傷人風險；為了好泵而在現場加水會降低強度與彈性模數，直接增加牆柱縮短量。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A blockage at height lets concrete harden in the line under hundreds of bar, forcing pipes to be dismantled, delaying work and risking burst-pipe injuries; adding water on site to ease pumping lowers strength and elastic modulus and directly increases wall and column shortening. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"正式泵送前以水平繞管試驗量測每公尺壓力損失與出口坍流度；施工中監測泵壓、管線溫度與出口材料性質，定期取樣試驗強度，並在管線各段訂出洗管與排堵程序。塔尖鋼構分段吊裝或頂升時，須有分階段的穩定與臨時支撐計算。","textEn":"Before production pumping, measure pressure loss per metre and discharge slump flow in a horizontal loop trial; during construction monitor pump pressure, line temperature and discharge properties, sample strength regularly, and set wash-out and blockage-clearing procedures for each line section. Erecting spire steel in segments or by jacking needs stage-by-stage stability and temporary-support calculations.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"泵送計畫要列出每段高度的配比、骨材粒徑、預估壓力與備用泵；管線固定點、彎管與安全護罩須經檢查，壓力超過設定值即停止泵送，由技術主管判斷後才可續作，並禁止現場加水。","textEn":"The pumping plan should list the mix, aggregate size, predicted pressure and standby pump for each height band; pipe anchors, bends and safety guards must be inspected, pumping stops whenever pressure exceeds the set value until the technical manager decides, and adding water on site is prohibited.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「約 600 m 的混凝土泵送與塔尖鋼構」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pumping concrete to about 600 m and the steel spire\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","混凝土強度夠高，徐變與縮短就可以忽略。","正式泵送前以水平繞管試驗量測每公尺壓力損失與出口坍流度；施工中監測泵壓、管線溫度與出口材料性質，定期取樣試驗強度，並在管線各段訂出洗管與排堵程序。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","With high enough concrete strength, creep and shortening can be ignored.","Before production pumping, measure pressure loss per metre and discharge slump flow in a horizontal loop trial."],"answer":2,"explanation":"正式泵送前以水平繞管試驗量測每公尺壓力損失與出口坍流度；施工中監測泵壓、管線溫度與出口材料性質，定期取樣試驗強度，並在管線各段訂出洗管與排堵程序。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before production pumping, measure pressure loss per metre and discharge slump flow in a horizontal loop trial; during construction monitor pump pressure, line temperature and discharge properties, sample strength regularly, and set wash-out and blockage-clearing procedures for each line section. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b022-v13-24","title":"約 600 m 的混凝土泵送與塔尖鋼構：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pumping concrete to about 600 m and the steel spire: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「超高壓泵送管線」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Super-high-pressure pump line” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"高空堵管時，管內混凝土在數百 bar 壓力下硬化，必須拆管清除，工期延誤並有爆管傷人風險；為了好泵而在現場加水會降低強度與彈性模數，直接增加牆柱縮短量。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A blockage at height lets concrete harden in the line under hundreds of bar, forcing pipes to be dismantled, delaying work and risking burst-pipe injuries; adding water on site to ease pumping lowers strength and elastic modulus and directly increases wall and column shortening. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：再往上改為鋼結構，塔尖使用超過 4,000 公噸以斜撐組成的鋼材。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Higher still the structure turns to steel, and the spire uses more than 4,000 t of braced structural steel.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「泵送高度只取決於泵機馬力，與混凝土配比無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Pumping height depends only on pump power, not on the concrete mix.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"高空堵管時，管內混凝土在數百 bar 壓力下硬化，必須拆管清除，工期延誤並有爆管傷人風險；為了好泵而在現場加水會降低強度與彈性模數，直接增加牆柱縮短量。","textEn":"A blockage at height lets concrete harden in the line under hundreds of bar, forcing pipes to be dismantled, delaying work and risking burst-pipe injuries; adding water on site to ease pumping lowers strength and elastic modulus and directly increases wall and column shortening.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「約 600 m 的混凝土泵送與塔尖鋼構」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pumping concrete to about 600 m and the steel spire\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["高空堵管時，管內混凝土在數百 bar 壓力下硬化，必須拆管清除，工期延誤並有爆管傷人風險；為了好泵而在現場加水會降低強度與彈性模數，直接增加牆柱縮短量。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","只要每層都以雷射對準設計座標，建築就一定是直的。"],"optionsEn":["A blockage at height lets concrete harden in the line under hundreds of bar, forcing pipes to be dismantled, delaying work and risking burst-pipe injuries.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","If every floor is laser-aligned to the design coordinates, the building will be straight."],"answer":0,"explanation":"高空堵管時，管內混凝土在數百 bar 壓力下硬化，必須拆管清除，工期延誤並有爆管傷人風險；為了好泵而在現場加水會降低強度與彈性模數，直接增加牆柱縮短量。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A blockage at height lets concrete harden in the line under hundreds of bar, forcing pipes to be dismantled, delaying work and risking burst-pipe injuries; adding water on site to ease pumping lowers strength and elastic modulus and directly increases wall and column shortening. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b022-v13-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「測量基準、垂直度與核心重新置中」與「徐變收縮監測與設計假設比對」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Survey datums, verticality and core re-centring\" and \"Creep and shrinkage monitoring against design assumptions\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b022-v13-25","title":"測量基準、垂直度與核心重新置中：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Survey datums, verticality and core re-centring: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-24"],"objective":"說明「GPS 垂直度監測」如何影響哈里發塔的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “GPS verticality monitoring” governs force, deformation or durability in “Burj Khalifa”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"超過 500 m 高的混凝土核心在施工中不斷受風、日照溫差、不均勻縮短與基礎沉陷影響而微幅偏移，傳統由地面往上投點的方式誤差會累積。哈里發塔採用專門的 GPS 監測系統檢核垂直度，並在每次六角核心爬升時重新置中，作為水平方向的補償；垂直方向則以略為加高樓層高度補償縮短。量測時必須把瞬間的擺動與溫度彎曲，從真正的施工誤差中分離出來。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「GPS 垂直度監測」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A concrete core more than 500 m tall shifts slightly all the time during construction under wind, solar temperature differences, uneven shortening and foundation settlement, and traditional upward plumbing from the ground accumulates error. Burj Khalifa used a dedicated GPS monitoring system to check verticality and re-centred the hex core at each jump as horizontal compensation, while vertical shortening was compensated by modestly increasing floor-to-floor heights. Surveys must separate momentary sway and thermal bowing from genuine construction error. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “GPS verticality monitoring” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：基礎差異沉陷造成的傾斜 θ = Δs/B。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Tilt from differential foundation settlement θ = Δs/B.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要每層都以雷射對準設計座標，建築就一定是直的。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If every floor is laser-aligned to the design coordinates, the building will be straight.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「GPS 垂直度監測」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “GPS verticality monitoring”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-25-k1","title":"測量基準、垂直度與核心重新置中","titleEn":"Survey datums, verticality and core re-centring","text":"超過 500 m 高的混凝土核心在施工中不斷受風、日照溫差、不均勻縮短與基礎沉陷影響而微幅偏移，傳統由地面往上投點的方式誤差會累積。哈里發塔採用專門的 GPS 監測系統檢核垂直度，並在每次六角核心爬升時重新置中，作為水平方向的補償；垂直方向則以略為加高樓層高度補償縮短。","textEn":"A concrete core more than 500 m tall shifts slightly all the time during construction under wind, solar temperature differences, uneven shortening and foundation settlement, and traditional upward plumbing from the ground accumulates error. Burj Khalifa used a dedicated GPS monitoring system to check verticality and re-centred the hex core at each jump as horizontal compensation, while vertical shortening was compensated by modestly increasing floor-to-floor heights.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要每層都以雷射對準設計座標，建築就一定是直的。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If every floor is laser-aligned to the design coordinates, the building will be straight. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「測量基準、垂直度與核心重新置中」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Survey datums, verticality and core re-centring\" is correct?","options":["只要每層都以雷射對準設計座標，建築就一定是直的。","超過 500 m 高的混凝土核心在施工中不斷受風、日照溫差、不均勻縮短與基礎沉陷影響而微幅偏移，傳統由地面往上投點的方式誤差會累積。","應變計讀數乘上彈性模數，就是構件的實際應力。"],"optionsEn":["If every floor is laser-aligned to the design coordinates, the building will be straight.","A concrete core more than 500 m tall shifts slightly all the time during construction under wind, solar temperature differences, uneven shortening and foundation settlement, and traditional upward plumbing from the ground accumulates error.","Multiplying a strain-gauge reading by the elastic modulus gives the member's actual stress."],"answer":1,"explanation":"超過 500 m 高的混凝土核心在施工中不斷受風、日照溫差、不均勻縮短與基礎沉陷影響而微幅偏移，傳統由地面往上投點的方式誤差會累積。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A concrete core more than 500 m tall shifts slightly all the time during construction under wind, solar temperature differences, uneven shortening and foundation settlement, and traditional upward plumbing from the ground accumulates error. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b022-v13-26","title":"測量基準、垂直度與核心重新置中：定量估算","titleEn":"Survey datums, verticality and core re-centring: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「GPS 垂直度監測」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “GPS verticality monitoring” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：基礎差異沉陷造成的傾斜 θ = Δs/B。若筏基兩端沉陷差 10 mm、寬度 60 m，θ = 10/60,000 ≈ 1/6,000；在 600 m 高處的水平偏移約 600,000/6,000 = 100 mm。若量測時忽略這個剛體傾斜，就會把 100 mm 誤判為施工誤差而錯誤修正。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Tilt from differential foundation settlement θ = Δs/B. A 10 mm settlement difference across a 60 m raft gives θ = 10/60,000 ≈ 1/6,000, or about 600,000/6,000 = 100 mm of horizontal offset at 600 m. If the survey ignores this rigid-body tilt, the 100 mm is misread as construction error and wrongly corrected. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在核心頂部設置 GPS 天線與傾斜儀連續記錄，以統計方法扣除風與溫度造成的週期性擺動；將結果與施工階段分析預測的變形及筏基沉陷量測比較，確認每次重新置中的修正量只針對真正的施工偏差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Fit GPS antennas and inclinometers at the top of the core, record continuously and statistically remove the periodic sway from wind and temperature; compare the results with deformations predicted by the construction-stage analysis and with measured raft settlement, so that each re-centring corrects only genuine construction deviation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"基礎差異沉陷造成的傾斜 θ = Δs/B。若筏基兩端沉陷差 10 mm、寬度 60 m，θ = 10/60,000 ≈ 1/6,000；在 600 m 高處的水平偏移約 600,000/6,000 = 100 mm。若量測時忽略這個剛體傾斜，就會把 100 mm 誤判為施工誤差而錯誤修正。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Tilt from differential foundation settlement θ = Δs/B. A 10 mm settlement difference across a 60 m raft gives θ = 10/60,000 ≈ 1/6,000, or about 600,000/6,000 = 100 mm of horizontal offset at 600 m. If the survey ignores this rigid-body tilt, the 100 mm is misread as construction error and wrongly corrected. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「測量基準、垂直度與核心重新置中」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Survey datums, verticality and core re-centring\", which statement holds?","options":["外牆維護設備只是清潔工具，不屬於結構工程的責任。","只要結構夠強，建築外形對風力的影響可以忽略。","基礎差異沉陷造成的傾斜 θ = Δs/B。"],"optionsEn":["Façade access equipment is just cleaning gear and not a structural engineering responsibility.","If the structure is strong enough, building shape has negligible effect on wind loads.","Tilt from differential foundation settlement θ = Δs/B."],"answer":2,"explanation":"基礎差異沉陷造成的傾斜 θ = Δs/B。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Tilt from differential foundation settlement θ = Δs/B. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b022-v13-27","title":"測量基準、垂直度與核心重新置中：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Survey datums, verticality and core re-centring: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「GPS 垂直度監測」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “GPS verticality monitoring” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在核心頂部設置 GPS 天線與傾斜儀連續記錄，以統計方法扣除風與溫度造成的週期性擺動；將結果與施工階段分析預測的變形及筏基沉陷量測比較，確認每次重新置中的修正量只針對真正的施工偏差。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Fit GPS antennas and inclinometers at the top of the core, record continuously and statistically remove the periodic sway from wind and temperature; compare the results with deformations predicted by the construction-stage analysis and with measured raft settlement, so that each re-centring corrects only genuine construction deviation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：測量計畫要規定量測時段、溫度與風速條件、基準點複核頻率，並寫清楚「設計座標」指的是完工長期狀態還是施工當下狀態；每次重新置中的修正量由結構工程師與測量主管共同簽認。","observationEn":"Site practice: The survey plan should fix measurement times, temperature and wind conditions and datum re-check frequency, and say clearly whether design coordinates mean the long-term completed state or the current construction state; each re-centring correction is signed jointly by the structural engineer and the survey lead.","failure":"注意干擾：若在午後日照最強時投點並據以修正，核心冷卻後會偏向另一側，等於把建築做歪；若垂直縮短補償不足，完工多年後樓板標高低於設計值，影響電梯停靠精度與帷幕牆接縫。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Setting out in the hottest afternoon sun and correcting from it leaves the core leaning the other way once it cools, building the tower crooked; insufficient vertical compensation leaves floors below design level years later, affecting elevator levelling and curtain-wall joints. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在核心頂部設置 GPS 天線與傾斜儀連續記錄，以統計方法扣除風與溫度造成的週期性擺動；將結果與施工階段分析預測的變形及筏基沉陷量測比較，確認每次重新置中的修正量只針對真正的施工偏差。","textEn":"Fit GPS antennas and inclinometers at the top of the core, record continuously and statistically remove the periodic sway from wind and temperature; compare the results with deformations predicted by the construction-stage analysis and with measured raft settlement, so that each re-centring corrects only genuine construction deviation.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"測量計畫要規定量測時段、溫度與風速條件、基準點複核頻率，並寫清楚「設計座標」指的是完工長期狀態還是施工當下狀態；每次重新置中的修正量由結構工程師與測量主管共同簽認。","textEn":"The survey plan should fix measurement times, temperature and wind conditions and datum re-check frequency, and say clearly whether design coordinates mean the long-term completed state or the current construction state; each re-centring correction is signed jointly by the structural engineer and the survey lead.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「測量基準、垂直度與核心重新置中」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Survey datums, verticality and core re-centring\"?","options":["在核心頂部設置 GPS 天線與傾斜儀連續記錄，以統計方法扣除風與溫度造成的週期性擺動。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","沒有打到堅硬岩盤的摩擦樁，不能支承超高層建築。"],"optionsEn":["Fit GPS antennas and inclinometers at the top of the core, record continuously and statistically remove the periodic sway from wind and temperature.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Friction piles that do not reach hard rock cannot support a supertall tower."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在核心頂部設置 GPS 天線與傾斜儀連續記錄，以統計方法扣除風與溫度造成的週期性擺動；將結果與施工階段分析預測的變形及筏基沉陷量測比較，確認每次重新置中的修正量只針對真正的施工偏差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Fit GPS antennas and inclinometers at the top of the core, record continuously and statistically remove the periodic sway from wind and temperature; compare the results with deformations predicted by the construction-stage analysis and with measured raft settlement, so that each re-centring corrects only genuine construction deviation. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b022-v13-28","title":"測量基準、垂直度與核心重新置中：失效診斷","titleEn":"Survey datums, verticality and core re-centring: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「GPS 垂直度監測」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “GPS verticality monitoring” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若在午後日照最強時投點並據以修正，核心冷卻後會偏向另一側，等於把建築做歪；若垂直縮短補償不足，完工多年後樓板標高低於設計值，影響電梯停靠精度與帷幕牆接縫。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Setting out in the hottest afternoon sun and correcting from it leaves the core leaning the other way once it cools, building the tower crooked; insufficient vertical compensation leaves floors below design level years later, affecting elevator levelling and curtain-wall joints. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：量測時必須把瞬間的擺動與溫度彎曲，從真正的施工誤差中分離出來。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Surveys must separate momentary sway and thermal bowing from genuine construction error.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要每層都以雷射對準設計座標，建築就一定是直的。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If every floor is laser-aligned to the design coordinates, the building will be straight.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若在午後日照最強時投點並據以修正，核心冷卻後會偏向另一側，等於把建築做歪；若垂直縮短補償不足，完工多年後樓板標高低於設計值，影響電梯停靠精度與帷幕牆接縫。","textEn":"Setting out in the hottest afternoon sun and correcting from it leaves the core leaning the other way once it cools, building the tower crooked; insufficient vertical compensation leaves floors below design level years later, affecting elevator levelling and curtain-wall joints.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「測量基準、垂直度與核心重新置中」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Survey datums, verticality and core re-centring\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","若在午後日照最強時投點並據以修正，核心冷卻後會偏向另一側，等於把建築做歪；若垂直縮短補償不足，完工多年後樓板標高低於設計值，影響電梯停靠精度與帷幕牆接縫。","應變計讀數乘上彈性模數，就是構件的實際應力。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Setting out in the hottest afternoon sun and correcting from it leaves the core leaning the other way once it cools, building the tower crooked.","Multiplying a strain-gauge reading by the elastic modulus gives the member's actual stress."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若在午後日照最強時投點並據以修正，核心冷卻後會偏向另一側，等於把建築做歪；若垂直縮短補償不足，完工多年後樓板標高低於設計值，影響電梯停靠精度與帷幕牆接縫。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Setting out in the hottest afternoon sun and correcting from it leaves the core leaning the other way once it cools, building the tower crooked; insufficient vertical compensation leaves floors below design level years later, affecting elevator levelling and curtain-wall joints. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b022-v13-29","title":"徐變收縮監測與設計假設比對：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Creep and shrinkage monitoring against design assumptions: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-28"],"objective":"說明「應變計與長期監測」如何影響哈里發塔的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Strain gauges and long-term monitoring” governs force, deformation or durability in “Burj Khalifa”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"哈里發塔的監測計畫由專業監測廠商供應安裝，涵蓋施工前的試驗樁、施工期間以應變計量測的應力分布，以及混凝土的徐變、乾縮與彈性性質，並把量測與模型預測比較，超過設計限值時即時警報。監測的價值在於分解應變：同一支應變計讀到的總應變包含彈性、徐變、乾縮與溫度分量，只有分離之後才能回推真正的應力與構件縮短。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「應變計與長期監測」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Burj Khalifa's monitoring programme, supplied and installed by a specialist monitoring firm, covered trial piles before construction and, during construction, stress distribution from strain gauges and the creep, shrinkage and elastic properties of the concrete, compared with model predictions and with real-time alarms if design limits were exceeded. The value of monitoring lies in decomposing strain: one gauge's total reading combines elastic, creep, shrinkage and thermal components, and only after separating them can the true stress and member shortening be back-calculated. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Strain gauges and long-term monitoring” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：彈性應變 = 總應變 − 徐變 − 乾縮 − 溫度。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Elastic strain = total − creep − shrinkage − thermal.","failure":"常見誤解：「應變計讀數乘上彈性模數，就是構件的實際應力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Multiplying a strain-gauge reading by the elastic modulus gives the member's actual stress.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「應變計與長期監測」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Strain gauges and long-term monitoring”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-29-k1","title":"徐變收縮監測與設計假設比對","titleEn":"Creep and shrinkage monitoring against design assumptions","text":"哈里發塔的監測計畫由專業監測廠商供應安裝，涵蓋施工前的試驗樁、施工期間以應變計量測的應力分布，以及混凝土的徐變、乾縮與彈性性質，並把量測與模型預測比較，超過設計限值時即時警報。監測的價值在於分解應變：同一支應變計讀到的總應變包含彈性、徐變、乾縮與溫度分量，只有分離之後才能回推真正的應力與構件縮短。","textEn":"Burj Khalifa's monitoring programme, supplied and installed by a specialist monitoring firm, covered trial piles before construction and, during construction, stress distribution from strain gauges and the creep, shrinkage and elastic properties of the concrete, compared with model predictions and with real-time alarms if design limits were exceeded. The value of monitoring lies in decomposing strain: one gauge's total reading combines elastic, creep, shrinkage and thermal components, and only after separating them can the true stress and member shortening be back-calculated.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：應變計讀數乘上彈性模數，就是構件的實際應力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Multiplying a strain-gauge reading by the elastic modulus gives the member's actual stress. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「徐變收縮監測與設計假設比對」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Creep and shrinkage monitoring against design assumptions\" is correct?","options":["應變計讀數乘上彈性模數，就是構件的實際應力。","基礎埋在地下、不接觸空氣，所以不會腐蝕。","哈里發塔的監測計畫由專業監測廠商供應安裝，涵蓋施工前的試驗樁、施工期間以應變計量測的應力分布，以及混凝土的徐變、乾縮與彈性性質，並把量測與模型預測比較，超過設計限值時即時警報。"],"optionsEn":["Multiplying a strain-gauge reading by the elastic modulus gives the member's actual stress.","Foundations are buried away from air, so they cannot corrode.","Burj Khalifa's monitoring programme, supplied and installed by a specialist monitoring firm, covered trial piles before construction and, during construction, stress distribution from strain gauges and the creep, shrinkage and elastic properties of the concrete, compared with model predictions and with real-time alarms if design limits were exceeded."],"answer":2,"explanation":"哈里發塔的監測計畫由專業監測廠商供應安裝，涵蓋施工前的試驗樁、施工期間以應變計量測的應力分布，以及混凝土的徐變、乾縮與彈性性質，並把量測與模型預測比較，超過設計限值時即時警報。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Burj Khalifa's monitoring programme, supplied and installed by a specialist monitoring firm, covered trial piles before construction and, during construction, stress distribution from strain gauges and the creep, shrinkage and elastic properties of the concrete, compared with model predictions and with real-time alarms if design limits were exceeded. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b022-v13-30","title":"徐變收縮監測與設計假設比對：定量估算","titleEn":"Creep and shrinkage monitoring against design assumptions: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「應變計與長期監測」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Strain gauges and long-term monitoring” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：彈性應變 = 總應變 − 徐變 − 乾縮 − 溫度。若某牆量得 600 με，預估乾縮 200 με、徐變 250 με、溫度 0，彈性應變為 150 με，應力 σ = E·ε = 43,800×150×10⁻⁶ ≈ 6.6 MPa；若乾縮實際只有 120 με，回推應力變成約 10.1 MPa。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Elastic strain = total − creep − shrinkage − thermal. If a wall reads 600 με with predicted shrinkage of 200 με, creep of 250 με and no thermal strain, the elastic strain is 150 με and σ = E·ε = 43,800×150×10⁻⁶ ≈ 6.6 MPa; if shrinkage is really only 120 με, the back-calculated stress becomes about 10.1 MPa. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在受力應變計旁設置不受力的補償試體（無應力計），直接量測乾縮與溫度應變；應變計安裝前後拍照記錄方位，資料定期與施工階段分析比較，偏差超過設定範圍時由設計者檢討材料參數。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Install unloaded companion specimens, known as no-stress meters, next to loaded gauges to measure shrinkage and thermal strain directly; photograph gauge orientation before and after installation, compare data periodically with the construction-stage analysis, and have the designer review material parameters when deviations exceed set bounds.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"彈性應變 = 總應變 − 徐變 − 乾縮 − 溫度。若某牆量得 600 με，預估乾縮 200 με、徐變 250 με、溫度 0，彈性應變為 150 με，應力 σ = E·ε = 43,800×150×10⁻⁶ ≈ 6.6 MPa；若乾縮實際只有 120 με，回推應力變成約 10.1 MPa。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Elastic strain = total − creep − shrinkage − thermal. If a wall reads 600 με with predicted shrinkage of 200 με, creep of 250 με and no thermal strain, the elastic strain is 150 με and σ = E·ε = 43,800×150×10⁻⁶ ≈ 6.6 MPa; if shrinkage is really only 120 με, the back-calculated stress becomes about 10.1 MPa. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「徐變收縮監測與設計假設比對」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Creep and shrinkage monitoring against design assumptions\", which statement holds?","options":["彈性應變 = 總應變 − 徐變 − 乾縮 − 溫度。","Y 形平面只是為了造型與景觀，對結構沒有好處。","混凝土強度夠高，徐變與縮短就可以忽略。"],"optionsEn":["Elastic strain = total − creep − shrinkage − thermal.","The Y-shaped plan is only for appearance and views and gives no structural benefit.","With high enough concrete strength, creep and shortening can be ignored."],"answer":0,"explanation":"彈性應變 = 總應變 − 徐變 − 乾縮 − 溫度。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Elastic strain = total − creep − shrinkage − thermal. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b022-v13-31","title":"徐變收縮監測與設計假設比對：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Creep and shrinkage monitoring against design assumptions: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「應變計與長期監測」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Strain gauges and long-term monitoring” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在受力應變計旁設置不受力的補償試體（無應力計），直接量測乾縮與溫度應變；應變計安裝前後拍照記錄方位，資料定期與施工階段分析比較，偏差超過設定範圍時由設計者檢討材料參數。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Install unloaded companion specimens, known as no-stress meters, next to loaded gauges to measure shrinkage and thermal strain directly; photograph gauge orientation before and after installation, compare data periodically with the construction-stage analysis, and have the designer review material parameters when deviations exceed set bounds. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：監測規範要列出感測器數量與位置、無應力計配置、初讀值時機、資料格式、警戒值與通報流程；電纜路徑與保護要標示在施工圖上，交接時連同原始資料一起移交業主。","observationEn":"Site practice: The monitoring specification should list sensor numbers and locations, no-stress meter layout, initial-reading timing, data format, alert levels and reporting procedure; mark cable routes and protection on the construction drawings and hand all raw data to the owner at handover.","failure":"注意干擾：沒有無應力計時，乾縮被誤當成受力應變，回推的應力可能偏差五成以上；感測器電纜在後續施工中被切斷，或資料沒有備份，關鍵的早期數據就永久遺失。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Without no-stress meters, shrinkage is mistaken for load strain and back-calculated stress can be off by 50% or more; cables cut by later trades or unbacked-up data permanently lose the crucial early readings. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在受力應變計旁設置不受力的補償試體（無應力計），直接量測乾縮與溫度應變；應變計安裝前後拍照記錄方位，資料定期與施工階段分析比較，偏差超過設定範圍時由設計者檢討材料參數。","textEn":"Install unloaded companion specimens, known as no-stress meters, next to loaded gauges to measure shrinkage and thermal strain directly; photograph gauge orientation before and after installation, compare data periodically with the construction-stage analysis, and have the designer review material parameters when deviations exceed set bounds.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"監測規範要列出感測器數量與位置、無應力計配置、初讀值時機、資料格式、警戒值與通報流程；電纜路徑與保護要標示在施工圖上，交接時連同原始資料一起移交業主。","textEn":"The monitoring specification should list sensor numbers and locations, no-stress meter layout, initial-reading timing, data format, alert levels and reporting procedure; mark cable routes and protection on the construction drawings and hand all raw data to the owner at handover.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「徐變收縮監測與設計假設比對」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Creep and shrinkage monitoring against design assumptions\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","在受力應變計旁設置不受力的補償試體（無應力計），直接量測乾縮與溫度應變。","爬模只是一套模板，爬升時機由工班依進度自行決定即可。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Install unloaded companion specimens, known as no-stress meters, next to loaded gauges to measure shrinkage and thermal strain directly.","A climbing form is just formwork, so the crew can decide when to climb based on progress."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在受力應變計旁設置不受力的補償試體（無應力計），直接量測乾縮與溫度應變；應變計安裝前後拍照記錄方位，資料定期與施工階段分析比較，偏差超過設定範圍時由設計者檢討材料參數。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Install unloaded companion specimens, known as no-stress meters, next to loaded gauges to measure shrinkage and thermal strain directly; photograph gauge orientation before and after installation, compare data periodically with the construction-stage analysis, and have the designer review material parameters when deviations exceed set bounds. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b022-v13-32","title":"徐變收縮監測與設計假設比對：失效診斷","titleEn":"Creep and shrinkage monitoring against design assumptions: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「應變計與長期監測」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Strain gauges and long-term monitoring” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"沒有無應力計時，乾縮被誤當成受力應變，回推的應力可能偏差五成以上；感測器電纜在後續施工中被切斷，或資料沒有備份，關鍵的早期數據就永久遺失。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Without no-stress meters, shrinkage is mistaken for load strain and back-calculated stress can be off by 50% or more; cables cut by later trades or unbacked-up data permanently lose the crucial early readings. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：監測的價值在於分解應變：同一支應變計讀到的總應變包含彈性、徐變、乾縮與溫度分量，只有分離之後才能回推真正的應力與構件縮短。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The value of monitoring lies in decomposing strain: one gauge's total reading combines elastic, creep, shrinkage and thermal components, and only after separating them can the true stress and member shortening be back-calculated.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「應變計讀數乘上彈性模數，就是構件的實際應力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Multiplying a strain-gauge reading by the elastic modulus gives the member's actual stress.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"沒有無應力計時，乾縮被誤當成受力應變，回推的應力可能偏差五成以上；感測器電纜在後續施工中被切斷，或資料沒有備份，關鍵的早期數據就永久遺失。","textEn":"Without no-stress meters, shrinkage is mistaken for load strain and back-calculated stress can be off by 50% or more; cables cut by later trades or unbacked-up data permanently lose the crucial early readings.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「徐變收縮監測與設計假設比對」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Creep and shrinkage monitoring against design assumptions\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","基礎埋在地下、不接觸空氣，所以不會腐蝕。","沒有無應力計時，乾縮被誤當成受力應變，回推的應力可能偏差五成以上；感測器電纜在後續施工中被切斷，或資料沒有備份，關鍵的早期數據就永久遺失。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Foundations are buried away from air, so they cannot corrode.","Without no-stress meters, shrinkage is mistaken for load strain and back-calculated stress can be off by 50% or more."],"answer":2,"explanation":"沒有無應力計時，乾縮被誤當成受力應變，回推的應力可能偏差五成以上；感測器電纜在後續施工中被切斷，或資料沒有備份，關鍵的早期數據就永久遺失。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Without no-stress meters, shrinkage is mistaken for load strain and back-calculated stress can be off by 50% or more; cables cut by later trades or unbacked-up data permanently lose the crucial early readings. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b022-v13-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「鹽水地層中的基礎耐久」與「26,000 片帷幕與外牆維護系統的交接」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Foundation durability in saline ground\" and \"Handing over 26,000 cladding panels and the façade access system\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b022-v13-33","title":"鹽水地層中的基礎耐久：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Foundation durability in saline ground: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-32"],"objective":"說明「高鹽分地下水」如何影響哈里發塔的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Saline groundwater” governs force, deformation or durability in “Burj Khalifa”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"杜拜的地下水含有高濃度鹽分，公開論文記載氯離子可達 4.5%、硫酸鹽可達 0.6%，對筏基與樁身的混凝土及鋼筋都是長期威脅。對策從材料開始：筏基採 40% 飛灰、水膠比 0.34，樁身採 25% 飛灰與 7% 矽灰、水膠比 0.32 的自充填混凝土，以降低滲透性並提高抗硫酸鹽能力，再配合足夠的保護層與防水、防蝕措施。基礎埋在地下無法目視檢查，耐久設計必須一次做對。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「高鹽分地下水」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Dubai's groundwater is highly saline; the published paper records chlorides up to 4.5% and sulfates up to 0.6%, a long-term threat to raft and pile concrete and reinforcement. The response starts with materials: the raft uses 40% fly ash at a water–cement ratio of 0.34 and the piles a self-consolidating mix with 25% fly ash and 7% silica fume at 0.32, lowering permeability and improving sulfate resistance, backed by adequate cover and waterproofing and corrosion-protection measures. Buried foundations cannot be inspected visually, so durability design must be right the first time. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Saline groundwater” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：氯離子滲透深度約 x ≈ 2·√(D·t)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Chloride penetration depth is roughly x ≈ 2·√(D·t).","failure":"常見誤解：「基礎埋在地下、不接觸空氣，所以不會腐蝕。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Foundations are buried away from air, so they cannot corrode.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「高鹽分地下水」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Saline groundwater”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-33-k1","title":"鹽水地層中的基礎耐久","titleEn":"Foundation durability in saline ground","text":"杜拜的地下水含有高濃度鹽分，公開論文記載氯離子可達 4.5%、硫酸鹽可達 0.6%，對筏基與樁身的混凝土及鋼筋都是長期威脅。對策從材料開始：筏基採 40% 飛灰、水膠比 0.34，樁身採 25% 飛灰與 7% 矽灰、水膠比 0.32 的自充填混凝土，以降低滲透性並提高抗硫酸鹽能力，再配合足夠的保護層與防水、防蝕措施。","textEn":"Dubai's groundwater is highly saline; the published paper records chlorides up to 4.5% and sulfates up to 0.6%, a long-term threat to raft and pile concrete and reinforcement. The response starts with materials: the raft uses 40% fly ash at a water–cement ratio of 0.34 and the piles a self-consolidating mix with 25% fly ash and 7% silica fume at 0.32, lowering permeability and improving sulfate resistance, backed by adequate cover and waterproofing and corrosion-protection measures.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：基礎埋在地下、不接觸空氣，所以不會腐蝕。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Foundations are buried away from air, so they cannot corrode. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「鹽水地層中的基礎耐久」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Foundation durability in saline ground\" is correct?","options":["杜拜的地下水含有高濃度鹽分，公開論文記載氯離子可達 4.5%、硫酸鹽可達 0.6%，對筏基與樁身的混凝土及鋼筋都是長期威脅。","基礎埋在地下、不接觸空氣，所以不會腐蝕。","外牆維護設備只是清潔工具，不屬於結構工程的責任。"],"optionsEn":["Dubai's groundwater is highly saline.","Foundations are buried away from air, so they cannot corrode.","Façade access equipment is just cleaning gear and not a structural engineering responsibility."],"answer":0,"explanation":"杜拜的地下水含有高濃度鹽分，公開論文記載氯離子可達 4.5%、硫酸鹽可達 0.6%，對筏基與樁身的混凝土及鋼筋都是長期威脅。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Dubai's groundwater is highly saline; the published paper records chlorides up to 4.5% and sulfates up to 0.6%, a long-term threat to raft and pile concrete and reinforcement. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b022-v13-34","title":"鹽水地層中的基礎耐久：定量估算","titleEn":"Foundation durability in saline ground: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「高鹽分地下水」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Saline groundwater” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：氯離子滲透深度約 x ≈ 2·√(D·t)。擴散係數 D = 1×10⁻¹² m²/s、t = 100 年（3.16×10⁹ s）時 x ≈ 2×√(3.16×10⁻³) ≈ 0.112 m = 112 mm；若以飛灰與矽灰把 D 降到 5×10⁻¹³ m²/s，x 約 79 mm。保護層須大於臨界濃度到達的深度並保留餘裕。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Chloride penetration depth is roughly x ≈ 2·√(D·t). With a diffusion coefficient D = 1×10⁻¹² m²/s over t = 100 years (3.16×10⁹ s), x ≈ 2×√(3.16×10⁻³) ≈ 0.112 m = 112 mm; cutting D to 5×10⁻¹³ m²/s with fly ash and silica fume gives about 79 mm. Cover must exceed the depth reached by the critical concentration, with margin. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：對配比做快速氯離子滲透或擴散試驗並設定允收上限，施工時抽驗保護層厚度與混凝土品質；長期則可埋設腐蝕感測器或參考電極，配合地下水水質定期檢測，追蹤基礎環境是否惡化。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Test the mixes for rapid chloride permeability or diffusion against set acceptance limits and spot-check cover and concrete quality during construction; in the long term, embedded corrosion sensors or reference electrodes plus periodic groundwater sampling track whether the foundation environment is deteriorating.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"氯離子滲透深度約 x ≈ 2·√(D·t)。擴散係數 D = 1×10⁻¹² m²/s、t = 100 年（3.16×10⁹ s）時 x ≈ 2×√(3.16×10⁻³) ≈ 0.112 m = 112 mm；若以飛灰與矽灰把 D 降到 5×10⁻¹³ m²/s，x 約 79 mm。保護層須大於臨界濃度到達的深度並保留餘裕。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Chloride penetration depth is roughly x ≈ 2·√(D·t). With a diffusion coefficient D = 1×10⁻¹² m²/s over t = 100 years (3.16×10⁹ s), x ≈ 2×√(3.16×10⁻³) ≈ 0.112 m = 112 mm; cutting D to 5×10⁻¹³ m²/s with fly ash and silica fume gives about 79 mm. Cover must exceed the depth reached by the critical concentration, with margin. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「鹽水地層中的基礎耐久」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Foundation durability in saline ground\", which statement holds?","options":["只要結構夠強，建築外形對風力的影響可以忽略。","氯離子滲透深度約 x ≈ 2·√(D·t)。","沒有打到堅硬岩盤的摩擦樁，不能支承超高層建築。"],"optionsEn":["If the structure is strong enough, building shape has negligible effect on wind loads.","Chloride penetration depth is roughly x ≈ 2·√(D·t).","Friction piles that do not reach hard rock cannot support a supertall tower."],"answer":1,"explanation":"氯離子滲透深度約 x ≈ 2·√(D·t)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Chloride penetration depth is roughly x ≈ 2·√(D·t). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b022-v13-35","title":"鹽水地層中的基礎耐久：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Foundation durability in saline ground: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「高鹽分地下水」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Saline groundwater” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"對配比做快速氯離子滲透或擴散試驗並設定允收上限，施工時抽驗保護層厚度與混凝土品質；長期則可埋設腐蝕感測器或參考電極，配合地下水水質定期檢測，追蹤基礎環境是否惡化。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Test the mixes for rapid chloride permeability or diffusion against set acceptance limits and spot-check cover and concrete quality during construction; in the long term, embedded corrosion sensors or reference electrodes plus periodic groundwater sampling track whether the foundation environment is deteriorating. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：設計基準書要寫明地下水化學分析、暴露等級、配比限制與保護層；樁身完整性試驗（如跨孔超音波或低應變試驗）列為逐樁驗收項目，結果與防蝕措施資料一起交給營運單位存檔。","observationEn":"Site practice: The design basis should state the groundwater chemistry, exposure class, mix limits and cover; make pile-integrity testing such as cross-hole sonic or low-strain tests a pile-by-pile acceptance item, and hand the results and corrosion-protection records to the operator.","failure":"注意干擾：樁身混凝土若在鑽掘泥漿中澆置不良而形成蜂窩或夾泥，鹽水會沿缺陷快速到達鋼筋，腐蝕膨脹使混凝土開裂並降低承載；這種損傷埋在地下，往往要到沉陷異常才被察覺。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Pile concrete placed poorly under drilling slurry can trap honeycombing or soil inclusions, letting brine reach the bars quickly; corrosion expansion cracks the concrete and reduces capacity, and because the damage is buried it often goes unnoticed until settlement becomes abnormal. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對配比做快速氯離子滲透或擴散試驗並設定允收上限，施工時抽驗保護層厚度與混凝土品質；長期則可埋設腐蝕感測器或參考電極，配合地下水水質定期檢測，追蹤基礎環境是否惡化。","textEn":"Test the mixes for rapid chloride permeability or diffusion against set acceptance limits and spot-check cover and concrete quality during construction; in the long term, embedded corrosion sensors or reference electrodes plus periodic groundwater sampling track whether the foundation environment is deteriorating.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"設計基準書要寫明地下水化學分析、暴露等級、配比限制與保護層；樁身完整性試驗（如跨孔超音波或低應變試驗）列為逐樁驗收項目，結果與防蝕措施資料一起交給營運單位存檔。","textEn":"The design basis should state the groundwater chemistry, exposure class, mix limits and cover; make pile-integrity testing such as cross-hole sonic or low-strain tests a pile-by-pile acceptance item, and hand the results and corrosion-protection records to the operator.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「鹽水地層中的基礎耐久」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Foundation durability in saline ground\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","泵送高度只取決於泵機馬力，與混凝土配比無關。","對配比做快速氯離子滲透或擴散試驗並設定允收上限，施工時抽驗保護層厚度與混凝土品質。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Pumping height depends only on pump power, not on the concrete mix.","Test the mixes for rapid chloride permeability or diffusion against set acceptance limits and spot-check cover and concrete quality during construction."],"answer":2,"explanation":"對配比做快速氯離子滲透或擴散試驗並設定允收上限，施工時抽驗保護層厚度與混凝土品質；長期則可埋設腐蝕感測器或參考電極，配合地下水水質定期檢測，追蹤基礎環境是否惡化。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Test the mixes for rapid chloride permeability or diffusion against set acceptance limits and spot-check cover and concrete quality during construction; in the long term, embedded corrosion sensors or reference electrodes plus periodic groundwater sampling track whether the foundation environment is deteriorating. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b022-v13-36","title":"鹽水地層中的基礎耐久：失效診斷","titleEn":"Foundation durability in saline ground: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「高鹽分地下水」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Saline groundwater” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"樁身混凝土若在鑽掘泥漿中澆置不良而形成蜂窩或夾泥，鹽水會沿缺陷快速到達鋼筋，腐蝕膨脹使混凝土開裂並降低承載；這種損傷埋在地下，往往要到沉陷異常才被察覺。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Pile concrete placed poorly under drilling slurry can trap honeycombing or soil inclusions, letting brine reach the bars quickly; corrosion expansion cracks the concrete and reduces capacity, and because the damage is buried it often goes unnoticed until settlement becomes abnormal. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：基礎埋在地下無法目視檢查，耐久設計必須一次做對。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Buried foundations cannot be inspected visually, so durability design must be right the first time.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「基礎埋在地下、不接觸空氣，所以不會腐蝕。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Foundations are buried away from air, so they cannot corrode.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"樁身混凝土若在鑽掘泥漿中澆置不良而形成蜂窩或夾泥，鹽水會沿缺陷快速到達鋼筋，腐蝕膨脹使混凝土開裂並降低承載；這種損傷埋在地下，往往要到沉陷異常才被察覺。","textEn":"Pile concrete placed poorly under drilling slurry can trap honeycombing or soil inclusions, letting brine reach the bars quickly; corrosion expansion cracks the concrete and reduces capacity, and because the damage is buried it often goes unnoticed until settlement becomes abnormal.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「鹽水地層中的基礎耐久」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Foundation durability in saline ground\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["樁身混凝土若在鑽掘泥漿中澆置不良而形成蜂窩或夾泥，鹽水會沿缺陷快速到達鋼筋，腐蝕膨脹使混凝土開裂並降低承載；這種損傷埋在地下，往往要到沉陷異常才被察覺。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","外牆維護設備只是清潔工具，不屬於結構工程的責任。"],"optionsEn":["Pile concrete placed poorly under drilling slurry can trap honeycombing or soil inclusions, letting brine reach the bars quickly.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Façade access equipment is just cleaning gear and not a structural engineering responsibility."],"answer":0,"explanation":"樁身混凝土若在鑽掘泥漿中澆置不良而形成蜂窩或夾泥，鹽水會沿缺陷快速到達鋼筋，腐蝕膨脹使混凝土開裂並降低承載；這種損傷埋在地下，往往要到沉陷異常才被察覺。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Pile concrete placed poorly under drilling slurry can trap honeycombing or soil inclusions, letting brine reach the bars quickly; corrosion expansion cracks the concrete and reduces capacity, and because the damage is buried it often goes unnoticed until settlement becomes abnormal. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b022-v13-37","title":"26,000 片帷幕與外牆維護系統的交接：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Handing over 26,000 cladding panels and the façade access system: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-36"],"objective":"說明「帷幕單元與外牆維護設備」如何影響哈里發塔的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Cladding units and façade access” governs force, deformation or durability in “Burj Khalifa”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"哈里發塔外牆有超過 26,000 片反射玻璃單元，典型單元約寬 1.4 m、高 3.3 m、重約 360 kg，必須在沙漠高溫、強烈日照與高空風壓下保持氣密水密。外牆清潔與維護分段處理：下段與中段以三條水平軌道上的吊籃機（每台約 1,500 kg），中上段以傳統吊臂吊籃，最頂部以繩索作業；公開資料指出一般條件下 36 名工人需三到四個月才能清潔整個外牆。外牆維護設備本身是固定在結構上的機械，交接時必須當作結構介面管理。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「帷幕單元與外牆維護設備」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Burj Khalifa's façade has more than 26,000 reflective glass units; a typical unit is about 1.4 m wide, 3.3 m high and about 360 kg, and must stay airtight and watertight under desert heat, intense sun and high-altitude wind pressure. Cleaning and maintenance are zoned: the lower and middle sections use bucket machines of about 1,500 kg each on three horizontal tracks, the upper middle uses conventional davit cradles and the very top is done by rope access; public sources say 36 workers need three to four months to clean the whole exterior in normal conditions. The access equipment is machinery fixed to the structure, so at handover it must be managed as a structural interface. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Cladding units and façade access” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：單元面積 1.4×3.3 = 4.62 m²，自重 360/4.62 ≈ 78 kg/m²；若設計負風壓 3.0 kPa，單元總吸力 3.0×4.62 ≈ 13.9 kN，四個固定點各約 3.5 kN；自重約 360×9.81 ≈ 3.5 kN 由兩個承重點各分擔約 1.8 kN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A unit of 1.4×3.3 = 4.62 m² weighing 360 kg is about 360/4.62 ≈ 78 kg/m²; under a design suction of 3.0 kPa the unit carries 3.0×4.62 ≈ 13.9 kN, about 3.5 kN at each of four anchors, while its self-weight of about 360×9.81 ≈ 3.5 kN is shared by two dead-load points at about 1.8 kN each.","failure":"常見誤解：「外牆維護設備只是清潔工具，不屬於結構工程的責任。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Façade access equipment is just cleaning gear and not a structural engineering responsibility.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「帷幕單元與外牆維護設備」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Cladding units and façade access”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-37-k1","title":"26,000 片帷幕與外牆維護系統的交接","titleEn":"Handing over 26,000 cladding panels and the façade access system","text":"哈里發塔外牆有超過 26,000 片反射玻璃單元，典型單元約寬 1.4 m、高 3.3 m、重約 360 kg，必須在沙漠高溫、強烈日照與高空風壓下保持氣密水密。外牆清潔與維護分段處理：下段與中段以三條水平軌道上的吊籃機（每台約 1,500 kg），中上段以傳統吊臂吊籃，最頂部以繩索作業；公開資料指出一般條件下 36 名工人需三到四個月才能清潔整個外牆。","textEn":"Burj Khalifa's façade has more than 26,000 reflective glass units; a typical unit is about 1.4 m wide, 3.3 m high and about 360 kg, and must stay airtight and watertight under desert heat, intense sun and high-altitude wind pressure. Cleaning and maintenance are zoned: the lower and middle sections use bucket machines of about 1,500 kg each on three horizontal tracks, the upper middle uses conventional davit cradles and the very top is done by rope access; public sources say 36 workers need three to four months to clean the whole exterior in normal conditions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：外牆維護設備只是清潔工具，不屬於結構工程的責任。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Façade access equipment is just cleaning gear and not a structural engineering responsibility. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「26,000 片帷幕與外牆維護系統的交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Handing over 26,000 cladding panels and the façade access system\" is correct?","options":["外牆維護設備只是清潔工具，不屬於結構工程的責任。","哈里發塔外牆有超過 26,000 片反射玻璃單元，典型單元約寬 1.4 m、高 3.3 m、重約 360 kg，必須在沙漠高溫、強烈日照與高空風壓下保持氣密水密。","Y 形平面只是為了造型與景觀，對結構沒有好處。"],"optionsEn":["Façade access equipment is just cleaning gear and not a structural engineering responsibility.","Burj Khalifa's façade has more than 26,000 reflective glass units.","The Y-shaped plan is only for appearance and views and gives no structural benefit."],"answer":1,"explanation":"哈里發塔外牆有超過 26,000 片反射玻璃單元，典型單元約寬 1.4 m、高 3.3 m、重約 360 kg，必須在沙漠高溫、強烈日照與高空風壓下保持氣密水密。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Burj Khalifa's façade has more than 26,000 reflective glass units; a typical unit is about 1.4 m wide, 3.3 m high and about 360 kg, and must stay airtight and watertight under desert heat, intense sun and high-altitude wind pressure. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b022-v13-38","title":"26,000 片帷幕與外牆維護系統的交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Handing over 26,000 cladding panels and the façade access system: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「帷幕單元與外牆維護設備」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Cladding units and façade access” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：單元面積 1.4×3.3 = 4.62 m²，自重 360/4.62 ≈ 78 kg/m²；若設計負風壓 3.0 kPa，單元總吸力 3.0×4.62 ≈ 13.9 kN，四個固定點各約 3.5 kN；自重約 360×9.81 ≈ 3.5 kN 由兩個承重點各分擔約 1.8 kN。風壓為教學假設，單元尺寸與重量取自公開資料。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A unit of 1.4×3.3 = 4.62 m² weighing 360 kg is about 360/4.62 ≈ 78 kg/m²; under a design suction of 3.0 kPa the unit carries 3.0×4.62 ≈ 13.9 kN, about 3.5 kN at each of four anchors, while its self-weight of about 360×9.81 ≈ 3.5 kN is shared by two dead-load points at about 1.8 kN each. The pressure is a teaching assumption; unit size and weight are from public sources. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：交接前完成外牆抽樣的現場水密試驗與錨定點拉拔試驗，外牆維護設備的軌道、吊臂與錨固由第三方檢驗並取得操作許可；建立單元編號資料庫，記錄每次破損更換的位置與原因。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before handover complete sample field water tests on the façade and pull-out tests on anchors; have the access-equipment tracks, davits and anchorages inspected by a third party and certified for operation; build a unit-numbered database recording the location and cause of every replacement.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"單元面積 1.4×3.3 = 4.62 m²，自重 360/4.62 ≈ 78 kg/m²；若設計負風壓 3.0 kPa，單元總吸力 3.0×4.62 ≈ 13.9 kN，四個固定點各約 3.5 kN；自重約 360×9.81 ≈ 3.5 kN 由兩個承重點各分擔約 1.8 kN。風壓為教學假設，單元尺寸與重量取自公開資料。","textEn":"A unit of 1.4×3.3 = 4.62 m² weighing 360 kg is about 360/4.62 ≈ 78 kg/m²; under a design suction of 3.0 kPa the unit carries 3.0×4.62 ≈ 13.9 kN, about 3.5 kN at each of four anchors, while its self-weight of about 360×9.81 ≈ 3.5 kN is shared by two dead-load points at about 1.8 kN each. The pressure is a teaching assumption; unit size and weight are from public sources.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「26,000 片帷幕與外牆維護系統的交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Handing over 26,000 cladding panels and the façade access system\", which statement holds?","options":["混凝土強度夠高，徐變與縮短就可以忽略。","爬模只是一套模板，爬升時機由工班依進度自行決定即可。","單元面積 1.4×3.3 = 4.62 m²，自重 360/4.62 ≈ 78 kg/m²。"],"optionsEn":["With high enough concrete strength, creep and shortening can be ignored.","A climbing form is just formwork, so the crew can decide when to climb based on progress.","A unit of 1.4×3.3 = 4.62 m² weighing 360 kg is about 360/4.62 ≈ 78 kg/m²."],"answer":2,"explanation":"單元面積 1.4×3.3 = 4.62 m²，自重 360/4.62 ≈ 78 kg/m²；若設計負風壓 3.0 kPa，單元總吸力 3.0×4.62 ≈ 13.9 kN，四個固定點各約 3.5 kN；自重約 360×9.81 ≈ 3.5 kN 由兩個承重點各分擔約 1.8 kN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A unit of 1.4×3.3 = 4.62 m² weighing 360 kg is about 360/4.62 ≈ 78 kg/m²; under a design suction of 3.0 kPa the unit carries 3.0×4.62 ≈ 13.9 kN, about 3.5 kN at each of four anchors, while its self-weight of about 360×9.81 ≈ 3.5 kN is shared by two dead-load points at about 1.8 kN each. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b022-v13-39","title":"26,000 片帷幕與外牆維護系統的交接：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Handing over 26,000 cladding panels and the façade access system: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「帷幕單元與外牆維護設備」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Cladding units and façade access” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"交接前完成外牆抽樣的現場水密試驗與錨定點拉拔試驗，外牆維護設備的軌道、吊臂與錨固由第三方檢驗並取得操作許可；建立單元編號資料庫，記錄每次破損更換的位置與原因。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before handover complete sample field water tests on the façade and pull-out tests on anchors; have the access-equipment tracks, davits and anchorages inspected by a third party and certified for operation; build a unit-numbered database recording the location and cause of every replacement. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接文件包含外牆單元圖、錨固與軌道荷重資料、設備檢驗證書、更換單元的吊運路線與備品清單；營運單位要定期檢驗軌道錨固，並在任何外牆改裝前諮詢結構與外牆顧問。","observationEn":"Site practice: Handover documents include unit drawings, anchorage and track load data, equipment inspection certificates, lifting routes for replacement units and a spares list; the operator inspects track anchorages periodically and consults the structural and façade consultants before any façade alteration.","failure":"注意干擾：若外牆維護設備軌道的錨栓疲勞或腐蝕未被發現，上千公斤的設備可能在高空失控；單元密封失效使雨水滲入，會腐蝕固定件並在高溫下加速劣化，最後形成玻璃脫落風險。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Undetected fatigue or corrosion of the track anchor bolts can let equipment weighing more than a tonne run out of control at height; failed unit seals let rainwater in, corroding fixings and accelerating deterioration in the heat until glass detachment becomes a risk. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"交接前完成外牆抽樣的現場水密試驗與錨定點拉拔試驗，外牆維護設備的軌道、吊臂與錨固由第三方檢驗並取得操作許可；建立單元編號資料庫，記錄每次破損更換的位置與原因。","textEn":"Before handover complete sample field water tests on the façade and pull-out tests on anchors; have the access-equipment tracks, davits and anchorages inspected by a third party and certified for operation; build a unit-numbered database recording the location and cause of every replacement.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接文件包含外牆單元圖、錨固與軌道荷重資料、設備檢驗證書、更換單元的吊運路線與備品清單；營運單位要定期檢驗軌道錨固，並在任何外牆改裝前諮詢結構與外牆顧問。","textEn":"Handover documents include unit drawings, anchorage and track load data, equipment inspection certificates, lifting routes for replacement units and a spares list; the operator inspects track anchorages periodically and consults the structural and façade consultants before any façade alteration.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「26,000 片帷幕與外牆維護系統的交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Handing over 26,000 cladding panels and the façade access system\"?","options":["交接前完成外牆抽樣的現場水密試驗與錨定點拉拔試驗，外牆維護設備的軌道、吊臂與錨固由第三方檢驗並取得操作許可；建立單元編號資料庫，記錄每次破損更換的位置與原因。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要每層都以雷射對準設計座標，建築就一定是直的。"],"optionsEn":["Before handover complete sample field water tests on the façade and pull-out tests on anchors.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","If every floor is laser-aligned to the design coordinates, the building will be straight."],"answer":0,"explanation":"交接前完成外牆抽樣的現場水密試驗與錨定點拉拔試驗，外牆維護設備的軌道、吊臂與錨固由第三方檢驗並取得操作許可；建立單元編號資料庫，記錄每次破損更換的位置與原因。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before handover complete sample field water tests on the façade and pull-out tests on anchors; have the access-equipment tracks, davits and anchorages inspected by a third party and certified for operation; build a unit-numbered database recording the location and cause of every replacement. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b022-v13-40","title":"26,000 片帷幕與外牆維護系統的交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Handing over 26,000 cladding panels and the façade access system: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"prerequisiteIds":["b022-v13-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「帷幕單元與外牆維護設備」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Cladding units and façade access” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若外牆維護設備軌道的錨栓疲勞或腐蝕未被發現，上千公斤的設備可能在高空失控；單元密封失效使雨水滲入，會腐蝕固定件並在高溫下加速劣化，最後形成玻璃脫落風險。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Undetected fatigue or corrosion of the track anchor bolts can let equipment weighing more than a tonne run out of control at height; failed unit seals let rainwater in, corroding fixings and accelerating deterioration in the heat until glass detachment becomes a risk. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：外牆維護設備本身是固定在結構上的機械，交接時必須當作結構介面管理。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The access equipment is machinery fixed to the structure, so at handover it must be managed as a structural interface.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「外牆維護設備只是清潔工具，不屬於結構工程的責任。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Façade access equipment is just cleaning gear and not a structural engineering responsibility.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b022-v13-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若外牆維護設備軌道的錨栓疲勞或腐蝕未被發現，上千公斤的設備可能在高空失控；單元密封失效使雨水滲入，會腐蝕固定件並在高溫下加速劣化，最後形成玻璃脫落風險。","textEn":"Undetected fatigue or corrosion of the track anchor bolts can let equipment weighing more than a tonne run out of control at height; failed unit seals let rainwater in, corroding fixings and accelerating deterioration in the heat until glass detachment becomes a risk.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]},{"id":"b022-v13-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「26,000 片帷幕與外牆維護系統的交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Handing over 26,000 cladding panels and the façade access system\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","若外牆維護設備軌道的錨栓疲勞或腐蝕未被發現，上千公斤的設備可能在高空失控；單元密封失效使雨水滲入，會腐蝕固定件並在高溫下加速劣化，最後形成玻璃脫落風險。","Y 形平面只是為了造型與景觀，對結構沒有好處。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Undetected fatigue or corrosion of the track anchor bolts can let equipment weighing more than a tonne run out of control at height.","The Y-shaped plan is only for appearance and views and gives no structural benefit."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若外牆維護設備軌道的錨栓疲勞或腐蝕未被發現，上千公斤的設備可能在高空失控；單元密封失效使雨水滲入，會腐蝕固定件並在高溫下加速劣化，最後形成玻璃脫落風險。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Undetected fatigue or corrosion of the track anchor bolts can let equipment weighing more than a tonne run out of control at height; failed unit seals let rainwater in, corroding fixings and accelerating deterioration in the heat until glass detachment becomes a risk. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v13s-ctbuh-burj-khalifa","v13s-som-burj-khalifa","v13s-ctbuh-paper-burj-dubai","v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-wiki-burj-khalifa"],"curriculumVersion":13,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
